<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Draft J, Oct. 10, 2006</book>
  <para style="h">Ayṯ-Ruma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rum</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayṯ-Ruma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Ruma</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Ruma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s">Bulus issekk-asen sȓam i ȓmuminin n Ruma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Nec ḏ Bulus axeddam n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, igg-ayi-d Arebbi aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ arrasul. Twaxḍareɣ ḥima aḏ xbareɣ s Lʼinjil n Arebbi, <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Lʼinjil-a iy zi iwƹeḏ Arebbi ḏi zman s yiȓes n lʼanbiya nnes ḏi Lkitab lmuqeddes. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3-4" />U manaya x Mmis Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Ƹlaḥsab ddat nnes ḏ bnaḏem netta zi ddurriṯ n Siḏna Dawed. Walakin ƹlaḥsab Arruḥ nnes iṣfan imeḍhar-d ḏ Mmis n Arebbi s yijjen n jjheḏ imɣar wami iy d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="ROM 1:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Aqa zi <char style="it">Ƹisa</char> u x ssabab n yisem nnes igga ḏayi Arebbi lbaraka ḥima aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ arrasul, aḏ beccareɣ iwḏan zi marra ȓegnus azzayes amnen aḏas ṭaƹen. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Uȓa ḏ kenniw zeg yinni itwaxḍaren aḏ teḏfarem Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Tariɣ i marra imƹizzen n Arebbi iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Ruma ixḍar-ikenniw aḏ tiȓim ḏ ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin. Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus irezzu aḏ iẓer ȓmuminin ḏi Ruma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Ḏ amezwaru, tcekkareɣ Arebbi xawem marra iḏwem s yisem n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ȓaḥeqqac lʼiman nwem arrin-as-d ȓexbar ḏi ddunect-a ṯekmaȓ. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9-10" />Liʼanna Arebbi iy ƹebbḏeɣ s marra uȓ inu tbeccareɣ s Lʼinjil n Mmis, netta qa issen tfekkareɣ ḏaywem ȓebda ḏi ṯẓaǧiṯ inu. Tettareɣ meȓa ixes Arebbi aȓ uneggaru aḏ afeɣ abriḏ aɣarwem d aseɣ. <verse eid="ROM 1:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Nec rezzuɣ s waṭṭas akenniw ẓreɣ ḥima aḏawem uceɣ ijjen n lqudra ruḥiya iy ḏawem ɣa yucen jjheḏ. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Iƹni a ncejjeƹ ayawya s lʼiman iy ḏayneɣ icarrcen.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Ay ayṯma, xseɣ aḏ tessnem belli aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin teggeɣ aɣarwem d aseɣ, walakin ȓexxu ƹaḏ war ɣarwem d uwiḍeɣ. Nec xseɣ ȓxeḏmeṯ inu aḏ tenjeḥ ḏaywem mammec ṯenjeḥ jar ȓegnus nneɣni. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Liʼanna u labud aḏ ggeɣ lwajib ak iyunaniyen ḏ yinni war iǧin ca ḏ iyunaniyen, ak yinni iɣrin ḏ yinni war iɣrin ca. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />S manaya nec rezzuɣ aṭṭas akenniw beccareɣ s Lʼinjil uȓa ḏ kenniw iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Ruma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jjheḏ n Lʼinjil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Aqa nec war tseḏḥiɣ ca zi Lʼinjil liʼanna Lʼinjil ḏ jjheḏ nni ig isxeddam Arebbi bac aḏ isenjem marra wi ɣa yamnen: Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ imezwura ṯumma yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Arebbi isbeyyen-aneɣ-d ḏi Lʼinjil mammec ɣa nemṣȓaḥ akiḏes, manaya s lʼiman waḥḏes. Mammec iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Wenni iǧan nican aḏ iƹic s lʼiman.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aɣḍab n Arebbi x ccarr n yiwḏan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Fa imeḍhar-d uɣḍab n Arebbi zeg ujenna x marra ccarr ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ iy teggen yiwḏan iƹni yinni itbeṭṭaȓen lḥaqiqa s ccarr nsen. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Aqa min zemmaren yiwḏan aṯ ssnen x Arebbi imeḍhar-asen-d, liʼanna Arebbi netta s yixef nnes iy ḏasen-t-id ismeḍharen. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Zeg wami ṯeǧa ddunect-a, min war itwaẓerren n Arebbi iƹni jjheḏ nnes itduman ḏ ṭṭabiƹa nnes yuƹȓan, nfehhem-iṯent nẓerr-iṯent mliḥ ḏi ṯmesȓayin itwaxeȓqen. Ƹlaḥsab manaya iwḏan war ɣarsen bu lƹuder. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Waxxa niṯni tuɣa ssnen Arebbi, walakin war ṯ ḥemmiḏen ca war ṯ ṯcekkaren ca mammec itxeṣṣa aḏ ggen ak Arebbi. Lʼafkar nsen ḏewȓent xwant, uȓawen nsen ḏ ibuhaȓiyen ḏewȓen ḏ ṯaǧest. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Ḥessben x yixef nsen ḏ imiɣisen, niṯni ḏewȓen ḏ ibuhaȓiyen. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Beddȓen lƹaḍama n Arebbi iddaren i ȓebda s lʼaṣnam itcabbahen ḏeg iwḏan iy ɣa ifnan, ḏ lʼaṣnam itcabbahen ḏeg yijḍaḍ ḏ lḥayawanaṯ ḏ min itenḥuruḏen.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />S manayenni isellem-iṯen Arebbi i min tcehhan wuȓawen nsen bac aḏ ggen lfasad bac aḏ sbehdȓen ayawya. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Kkaren beddȓen lḥaqiqa n Arebbi s ixarriqen. Ƹebbḏen xeddmen i min d itwaxeȓqen maci i Arebbi Lxaliq, wenni iy ḏi ṯeǧa lbaraka i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Amin.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ṯumma isellem-iṯen Arebbi i ccehawaṯ nsen iy ṯen ifeḍḥen. Kkarent ṯemɣarin beddȓent iryazen s ṯemɣarin. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Uȓa ḏ iryazen kkaren semḥen ḏi ṯemɣarin, ṯekkar ḏaysen ṯmessi ijjen x unneɣni, aryaz ifesseḏ ak uryaz. S manaya jebḏen-d lƹiqab i yixef nsen iy sḏaheǧen x ȓmunkar iy teggen.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Ssenni niṯni wami ugin aḏ ssnen Arebbi, isellem-iṯen i ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen infeḍḥen aḏ ggen min war iḥȓin. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Niṯni ccuren s kuȓ nnuƹ n ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ ḏ ccarr ḏ ṭṭmaƹ ḏ ȓeqbaḥeṯ ḏ ȓeḥseḏ. Neqqen iwḏan tmenɣan. Ccuren s uɣḏar ḏ min war iḥȓin, qqaren nnamima. <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />Qqaren ȓbaṭeȓ, tƹiffan Arebbi, tukkaren iwḏan, semɣaren ixef nsen, ḏaysen ttakebbur. Teggen nniṯ ccarr ḏ jḏiḏ, ƹeṣṣan lwalidin. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />War fehhmen ca, war teṭṭfen ca ḏeg wawaȓ nsen, war ḏaysen bu lḥanana uȓa ḏ arraḥmeṯ. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Waxxa ssnen Arebbi iḥekkem xasen s ȓmewṯ x yinni iteggen ṯimesȓayin-a, niṯni kkaren teggen-ṯent. Ktar zi manaya, reṭṭan x yinni iy ṯent iteggen.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Lḥisab n Arebbi aqaṯ nican</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Iḏen ay aryaz, cek meȓa tƹeyyabeḏ <char style="it">x yiwḏan</char>, ataf war ɣarek bu ȓḥaqq min ma ṯeƹniḏ. Liʼanna xmi tƹeyyabeḏ x can yijjen, tƹeyyabeḏ x yixef nnec, mayemmi? Liʼanna cek teggeḏ kif-kif mammec teggen niṯni! <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Wah, neccin nessen qa lƹiqab n Arebbi ihewwa nican x yinni iteggen ṯimesȓayin-a. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ay aryaz, iwa min tfekkareḏ? Ma aḏ tnejmeḏ zi lƹiqab n Arebbi wami tƹeyyabeḏ x yina u cek teggeḏ ṯmesȓayin-a kif-kif am niṯni? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Niɣ ṯseḥqareḏ lḥanana imɣaren n Arebbi ḏ ṣṣbar nnes ḏ ȓxaḍar iy ɣares? Ma war ṯessineḏ Arebbi s lḥanana nnes irezzu ac d isbeyyen abriḏ bac aḏ tubeḏ?<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Walakin cek s ṯɣennant-a iy ḏayek ḏ wuȓ nnec war ituben ca tesmuniḏ aɣḍab i yixef nnec aȓ Yum Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab, nhar iy ḏi d ɣa imeḍhar ȓḥukem n Arebbi s ȓḥaqq. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Ṯumma aḏ ixeǧes Arebbi mkuȓ ijjen x ȓexḏayem nnes. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Aḏasen yuc ṯuḏarṯ war ifennin ca i yinni iṣebbaren teggen lḥasanaṯ, liʼanna rezzun x lhimma ḏ uweqqar ḏ ṯuḏarṯ nni itduman. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Walakin aɣarsen yiȓi lḥisab ḏ lƹiqab ɣar yinni iy irezzun i yixef nsen waha ḏ yinni war itṭiƹin ca i lḥaqiqa ḏeffaren min war iǧin ca nican. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Aḏ yiȓi uziyyar ḏ tamara x kuȓ bnaḏem iteggen ssayyiʼaṯ, x yinni zi Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ imezwura ƹaḏ ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Walakin aḏ tiȓi lhimma ḏ uweqqar ḏ ȓehna i marra yinni iteggen lḥasanaṯ, Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ imezwura ƹaḏ ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Liʼanna Arebbi war itegg ca s wuḏemawen.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Cuf, marra yinni iƹeṣṣan niṯni war ɣarsen tiȓi bu ccariƹa, ataf aḏ fnan bȓa ccariƹa. Walakin yinni iƹeṣṣan ataf ɣarsen ccariƹa, aḏ twaḥakmen ƹlaḥsab ccariƹa nni. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Liʼanna iwḏan war tmeṣȓiḥen ca ag Arebbi meȓa tṣennaṭen waha i wawaȓ n ccariƹa; Lla, yinni iteggen array s min ḏayes ḏi ccariƹa, ataf ḏ yinni iy itmeṣȓaḥen ag Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />U ḏ ṣṣaḥ, yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil war ɣarsen ca ccariƹa, maƹlik teggen array s nniyyeṯ nsen min ḏayes ḏi ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char>, ataf niṯni aḏ iȓin ḏ ccariƹa s yixef nsen waxxa war ɣarsen ca ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char>. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Yina seḍharen-d belli min yurin ḏi ccariƹa aqaṯ ɣarsen yura ḏeg wuȓawen nsen. Ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen iy zi ṣaḥḥen manaya, ḍḍamir nsen iƹeǧem-asen xmi teggen min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan niɣ ḏ min iǧan war iḥȓin. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Iqqar Lʼinjil iy zi tḥeddaṯeɣ: <char style="it">Manaya aḏ yiȓi</char> ḏi Nhar nni xmi ɣa iḥaseb Arebbi x ufus n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ marra min inuffaren ḏeg wuȓawen n yiwḏan.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Min yurin x Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi ccariƹa n Siḏna Musa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Iwa cek, meȓa ṯḥessbeḏ ixef nnec ḏ aʼisraʼili, trajiḏ zi ccariƹa, teftaxareḏ s lƹalaqa nnec ak Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />Meȓa cek ṯessneḏ min ixes Arebbi, ṯessneḏ ƹaweḏ aḏ tixḍareḏ min iǧan nican liʼanna ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> ṯesfehham-ic. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Meȓa cek aqac metʼakked ṯzemmareḏ aḏ tsuyureḏ iḍarɣaȓen, cek ƹaweḏ aqac ḏ nnur i yinni iǧan ḏi ṯaǧest, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />ṯneṣṣḥeḏ yinni war issinen, ṯseȓmaḏeḏ imezyanen, liʼanna ɣarek ḏi ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> marra ṯusna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯusna nettaṯ ḏ lmaƹrifa.</char></note> ḏ lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Iwa cek iy iseȓmaḏen yinni, mayemmi war ṯseȓmiḏeḏ ca ixef nnec? Cek tḥeddaṯeḏ ṯeqqareḏ: "War tacar ca." Y cek, ma tacareḏ? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ṯeqqareḏ: "War zenna ca." Y cek, ma ṯzenniḏ? Cek tƹiffiḏ lʼaṣnam. Y cek, ma tacareḏ zi ṯemziḏawin? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Cek iteftaxaren zi ccariƹa, ma war tweqqareḏ ca Arebbi xmi ṯƹeṣṣiḏ min ḏayes ḏi ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char>? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Aqa mammec iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Ay Ayṯ-Israʼil, x ssabab nwem minzi qqaren awaȓen war iḥȓin x yisem n Arebbi yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Cek meȓa ṯxeddmeḏ s min ḏayes ḏi ccariƹa, ataf ṭṭahareṯ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṭṭahareṯ nettaṯ ḏ aḥejjem niɣ ḏ axṯan niɣ ḏ lxitam.</char></note> nnec aḏ tiȓi ɣares arbeḥ. Walakin meȓa ṯƹeṣṣiḏ ccariƹa, ataf aḏ tiȓiḏ axmi war ṯeggiḏ ca ṭṭahareṯ. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Innama, meȓa ḏinni can yijjen war iggi ca ṭṭahareṯ, netta ixeddem s min ḏayes ḏi ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char>, ataf wanita itwaḥsab axmi igga ṭṭahareṯ. <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Iƹni wenni ixeddmen s min ḏayes ḏi ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char>, waxxa war iggi ca ṭṭahareṯ ḏi ddat, axac iḥkem cek iy ɣar iǧa Lkitab nni ḏ ṭṭahareṯ. Mayemmi? Liʼanna cek ṯƹeṣṣiḏ ccariƹa. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Liʼanna wenni iǧan ḏ aʼisraʼili ḏ ṣṣaḥ, war iǧi am wenni d itbanen am israʼiliyen ḏi ddat waha. Ƹaweḏ ṭṭahareṯ n ṣṣaḥ war ṯeǧi ca ḏ ṯenni d itbanen ɣar barra waha x ddat. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Walakin aʼisraʼili iǧan ḏ ṣṣaḥ itiȓi ɣares manaya ɣar ḏaxeȓ. U ḏ ṭṭahareṯ n ṣṣaḥ tiȓi ḏeg wuȓ s Arruḥ n Arebbi, war iǧi bu s ccariƹa. Bnaḏem-a war ṯ tcekkaren ca yiwḏan, itcekkar-iṯ Arebbi.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s">Ȓḥaqq n Arebbi ismeḍhar-d ȓbaṭeȓ n yiwḏan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Iwa israʼiliyen, ma ɣarsen can nnfaƹ x yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil? Ƹaweḏ ṭṭahareṯ, ma ḏayes can nnfaƹ? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Wah, aṭṭas n nnfaƹ! Ḏ amezwaru, ijja-asen-d Arebbi awaȓ nnes ḏ lʼamana. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Iwa meȓa ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen war uminen ca, ma s lkufer nsen iy zi ɣa isbeṭṭeȓ Arebbi ȓƹaheḏ nnes? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Ƹemmarṣ! Ȓaḥeqqac Arebbi iqqar lḥaqiqa waxxa iwḏan marra sxerriqen. Mammec iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">&lt;Awaȓen nnec aḏ iȓin ṣeḥḥan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">cek aḏ trebḥeḏ xmi ɣa twaḥekmeḏ.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Fa meȓa ȓbaṭeȓ nneɣ iy ntegg ismeḍhar-d ȓḥaqq n Arebbi, min ɣa nini? (Nec ssawaȓeɣ ƹlaḥsab lfikra n bnaḏem.) Arebbi, ma iḍeǧem-aneɣ xmi ḏaneɣ itƹaqab? <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Lla, ƹemmarṣ! Maƹlik amenni, mammec ɣa igg Arebbi aḏ iḥaseb ddunect-a? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" /><char style="it">Imken aḏ yini can yijjen:</char> Mȓi ȓbaṭeȓ inu netta ismeḍhar-d mliḥ lḥaqiqa n Arebbi, mȓi zzayes itmarni Arebbi ḏi lƹaḍama nnes, iwa mayemmi ḏayi ɣa iḥseb ḏ lƹaṣi? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Niɣ <char style="it">aḏ yini can yijjen:</char> Yallah a negg ȓbaṭeȓ ḥima azzayes d ikk ȓxir. Amenni tahamen-aneɣ can yiwḏan s ẓẓur belli neqqar awaȓ-a. Iwḏan-a niṯni sḏaheǧen lƹiqab n Arebbi!<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwḏan marra ƹeṣṣan Arebbi war ǧin ca nican</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Iwa neccin Ayṯ-Israʼil, ma lḥala nneɣ ḥsen zeg yiwḏan nneɣni? Lla, ƹemmarṣ! Nenna qbeȓ qa Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil marra negga ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Mammmec iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">&lt;War iǧi ḥadd nican, uȓa ḏ ijjen.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Uȓa ḏ ijjen ma ifehhem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:11">War irezzu x Arebbi, uȓa ḏ ijjen.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Ffɣen abriḏ marra iḏsen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">ḏewȓen marra war neffƹen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">War iǧi ḥadd itegg min iṣebḥan.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Ṯmijja nsen ḏ anḍeȓ inurzmen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">iȓesawen nsen ixeddƹen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Ssem n ifiɣeran iteffeɣ-d zeg iyencicen nsen.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Nnaƹȓeṯ ḏ ṯarzugi iccur zzaysen uqemmum nsen.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Tqelliqen s iḍaren nsen aḏ sizzȓen iḏammen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iḏammen netta ḏ ddem.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Tejjan arrwina ḏ lʼazma mani ma ruḥen,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />abriḏ n ȓehna war ṯ ssinen.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Ṯiggwḏi zi Arebbi war ɣarsen ṯeǧi jar ṯiṭṭawin nsen.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Fa neccin nessen belli marra min ḏayes ḏi ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> tweṣṣa yinni ɣar ṯeǧa ccariƹa-ya bac uȓa ḏ ijjen war ɣares itiȓi bu lƹuder. U marra yinni iǧan ḏi ddunect-a aḏ iȓin swadday n lḥisab n Arebbi.<verse eid="ROM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Falihaḏa, uȓa ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem war izemmar aḏ imeṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi s ȓexḏayem iy ḏayes ḏi ccariƹa; Lla, ccariƹa ṯesbeyyan-aneɣ-d min ṯeƹna ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">S lʼiman waḥḏes iy zi netmeṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Fa ȓexxu Arebbi ismeḍhar-aneɣ-d mammec ɣa negg a nmeṣȓaḥ akiḏes bȓa ccariƹa. Manaya ṣaḥḥen-ṯ Lkutub n lʼanbiya ḏ ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> niṯni s yixef nsen. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22-23" />Iƹni, Arebbi isemṣȓaḥ akiḏes marra wenni itamnen zi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, war itferraq jar yiwḏan. Aqa marra ƹṣan Arebbi, twaḥarramen zi lƹaḍama nnes. <verse eid="ROM 3:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Arebbi, netta isemṣȓaḥ-iṯen akiḏes s arḍa nnes baṭeȓ s usenjem iy d yusin s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Arebbi iqeddem-iṯ ḏ lfidya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ƹadatan lfidya itxeǧas-it bnaḏem bac aḏ inja zi ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. Ḏanita iqqar Siḏi Arebbi belli iqeddem Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏ lfidya bac aḏ twasenjmen yiwḏan zi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen.</char></note> ḥima aḏ twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ s iḏammen nnes, iƹni i yinni iqebbȓen manayenni s lʼiman <char style="it">nsen</char>. S manayenni ismeḍhar-d Arebbi ȓḥaqq nnes. Netta tuɣa iṣebbar, war t yuwi ca ḏi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nni iy iƹḏun, <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />ḥima aḏ d ismeḍhar ḏi zman-a ȓḥaqq nnes. Liʼanna Arebbi netta nican ig iǧa, netta isemṣȓaḥ akiḏes wenni ɣa yamnen zi Ƹisa.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Iwa ma a neftaxer s can ȓḥajeṯ? Lla, memnuƹ! Ma memnuƹ s ccariƹa, iƹni s lḥasanaṯ? Lla, s lʼiman! <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Mayemmi? Ȓaḥeqqac neccin ɣarneɣ belli bnaḏem ismeṣȓah-iṯ Arebbi akiḏes s lʼiman <char style="it">nnes</char> bȓa lḥasanaṯ n ccariƹa. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Iwa Arebbi, ma netta ḏ Arebbi n Ayṯ-Israʼil waha? Lla! Ma war iǧi uȓa ḏ Arebbi n yiwḏan war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil? Wah, ḏ Arebbi nsen uȓa ḏ niṯni. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Liʼanna Arebbi netta ḏ ijjen. Ḏ netta ig ismeṣȓahen Ayṯ-Israʼil akiḏes s lʼiman, ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil s <char style="it">nnefs</char> lʼiman. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Iḏen, ma a nesbeṭṭeȓ ccariƹa s lʼiman-a? Ƹemmarṣ! Lla, neccin netḥama ccariƹa.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Siḏna Brahim ḏ lʼiman nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Iwa min ɣa nini x jeddiṯneɣ Brahim? Min ḏas iweqƹen i netta? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Maƹlik netta isemṣȓaḥ-iṯ Arebbi akiḏes ƹlaḥsab ȓexḏayem nnes,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ḏi lʼaya-ya ȓexḏayem ixes aḏ yini lḥasanaṯ.</char></note> ataf Brahim ɣares ȓḥaqq iy zi ɣa iftaxer zeg yixef nnes walakin zzaṯ i Arebbi lla. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Mamc iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:3">&lt;Uca yumen Brahim zi Arebbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:3">ikkar Arebbi isemṣȓaḥ-iṯ akiḏes s lʼiman nni.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Fa wenni ɣa iggen can ȓxeḏmeṯ, ma isḏaheǧ axas itwaxeǧes niɣ lla? Wah, manaya ḏ texȓiseṯ nnes maci ḏ kadu. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Wenni war itwekkiȓen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itwekkiȓen ixes aḏ yini itḵeȓ.</char></note> x ȓexḏayem ig itegg, itwekkiȓ x Arebbi itarran lƹaṣi ɣar ubriḏ, wanita isemṣȓaḥ-iṯ Arebbi akiḏes s lʼiman <char style="it">iy ḏayes</char>.<verse eid="ROM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />
    <char style="it">Nnabi</char> Dawed uȓa ḏ netta, issawaȓ x ssaƹḏ n bnaḏem wami ṯ isemṣȓaḥ Arebbi akiḏes bȓa ȓexḏayem. <char style="it">Iqqar</char>:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />&lt;Ssaƹḏ n yinni umi twaɣfarent ssayyiʼaṯ nsen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">twamḥant ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Ssaƹḏ n wenni war itḥisib Siḏi Arebbi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:8">x ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ <char style="it">nnes</char>.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />U ssaƹḏ-a, ma n yinni waḥeḏsen ig iteggen ṭṭahareṯ niɣ uȓa ḏ yinni war iteggen ca ṭṭahareṯ? Cuf, neccin neqqar: "Arebbi isemṣȓaḥ Brahim akiḏes s lʼiman <char style="it">nnes</char>." <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Meȓmi iy ṯ isemṣȓaḥ akiḏes Arebbi? Ma qbeȓ ma aḏ igg ṭṭahareṯ nnes niɣ menbaƹd ma t igg? Lla, maci menbaƹd i ṭṭahareṯ nnes walakin qbeȓ. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ṯumma ṭṭahareṯ-a ṯusa-as-d ḏ ijjen n lƹalama ḏ ijjen n ddalil belli Arebbi isemṣȓaḥ-iṯ akiḏes s lʼiman <char style="it">nni</char> iy tuɣa ḏayes qbeȓ ma aḏ iṭehhar. Mayemmi manaya? Bac aḏ yiȓi Brahim ḏ jeddiṯsen n yinni marra itamnen waxxa war ggin ca ṭṭahareṯ, bac uȓa ḏ yinni aṯen isemṣȓaḥ Arebbi akiḏes. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />U netta ḏ jeddiṯsen ƹaweḏ uȓa n yinni iggin ṭṭahareṯ, walakin maci ggin ṭṭahareṯ u ṣafi. Lla, itxeṣṣa-yasen aḏ ḏeffaren ȓaṯar n lʼiman mamc tuɣa iǧa ɣar jeddiṯneɣ Brahim wami tuɣa ƹaḏ war iggi bu ṭṭahareṯ.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arebbi iwƹeḏ Siḏna Brahim aɣares yiȓi mmis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Ȓƹaheḏ iy zi iwƹeḏ Arebbi Brahim ḏ ddurriṯ nnes ḥima aḏ iwareṯ netta ddunect. Ȓƹaheḏ nni war d yusi ca s ccariƹa, yusa-d s lʼiman nni ig isemṣȓaḥen iwḏan ak Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Maƹlik aḏ warṯen yinni iḏeffaren ccariƹa, ataf lʼiman-a walu, ataf ȓƹaheḏ-a ixwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Aqa ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> tawi-d lƹiqab n Arebbi. Walakin mani war tiȓi ca ccariƹa war tiȓi ca ḏinni ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />S manayenni ȓƹaheḏ-a ibna x lʼiman <char style="it">waḥḏes</char>: Ḥima ȓƹaheḏ-a aḏ d yas zi arḍa nnes, ḥima aṯ iḍmen Arebbi i marra ddurriṯ n Brahim. U maci ɣir wenni iḏeffaren ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char>; Lla, uȓa ḏ wenni icarrcen ḏi lʼiman n Brahim. Netta ḏ jeddiṯneɣ marra. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Mammec iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Arriɣ-cek ḏ jeddiṯsen i waṭṭas n ȓegnus.&gt;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 4:17" />
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 4:17">Ḏinni Brahim zzaṯ i Arebbi iy zi itamen, iƹni wenni d isnekkaren yinni immuṯen, iƹni wenni d ixeȓqen min ƹemmarṣ war iǧin. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Waxxa war ḏinni bu lʼamal qaƹ, yumen Brahim igga lʼamal. Amenni iy iḏweȓ ḏ jeddiṯsen i waṭṭas n ȓegnus mammec tuɣa ḏas itwanna zi qbeȓ: &lt;<char style="it">Min iǧan ḏ iṯran ḏeg ujenna</char> amenni iy ɣa ṯiȓi ddurriṯ nnec.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ṯumma lʼiman nnes war inqiṣ ca waxxa ɣares ƹȓayen miyya n iseggwusa, waxxa issen ixef nnes war izemmar ca ṯamɣarṯ nnes Sara war tirew ca. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Waxxa amenni war inqiṣ ca lʼiman nnes, war itcekki ca ḏi ȓƹaheḏ nni iy ḏas yuca Arebbi. Walakin yarenni ḏi lʼiman nnes iḥemmeḏ Arebbi, <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />netta aqaṯ metʼakked aṭṭas Arebbi izemmar aḏ ikemmeȓ x ȓƹaheḏ nnes. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />S manaya isemṣȓaḥ-iṯ Arebbi akiḏes.<verse eid="ROM 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Mayemmi iqqar Lkitab qa &lt;<char style="it">Arebbi</char> isemṣȓaḥ-iṯ <char style="it">akiḏes</char>&gt;? Ma iqqar awaȓ-a ƹlaḥsab Brahim waḥḏes? <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Lla, yura ƹaweḏ ƹlaḥsab neccin umi ḏaneɣ isemṣȓaḥ akiḏes wami zzayes numen zi Arebbi wenni iy d isekkaren Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa zi ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Itwasellem ḥima aḏ immeṯ x ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nneɣ, itwasekkar-d ḥima aḏaneɣ isemṣȓaḥ Arebbi akiḏes.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Ȓefraḥeṯ ḏ ȓehna ak Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Iḏen fa wami ḏaneɣ isemṣȓaḥ Arebbi akiḏes s lʼiman <char style="it">nneɣ</char> aqaneɣ ḏi ȓehna ak Arebbi x ufus n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Netta zzayes iy nufa abriḏ s lʼiman ɣar arḍa iy ḏi neǧa ȓexxu. Nfarreḥ ḏi lʼamal n lƹaḍama n Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />War iǧi ɣir manaya waha, nfarreḥ neccin uȓa ḏi ȓemḥayen. Nessen belli ȓemḥayen-a tarwent-id ṣṣbar. <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Ṣṣbar-a itarew ḏayneɣ minzi ɣa neɣȓeb x ȓemḥayen. S ȓeɣȓab-a x ȓemḥayen itarew ḏayneɣ lʼamal. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Lʼamal-a war ḏaneɣ itxeyyib ca, mayemmi? Liʼanna Arebbi yuca-aneɣ Arruḥ iqeddsen, zzayes ig iccur uȓawen nneɣ s ȓemḥibbeṯ nnes.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Fa ḏi ȓweqṯ nni nican ṯenni tuɣa ixḍar Arebbi neccin war ɣarneɣ bu jjheḏ, immuṯ Lmasiḥ xaneɣ wami neƹṣa. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Muḥaȓ aḏ iqbeȓ can yijjen aḏ immeṯ x yijjen n bnaḏem nneɣni ḏ aṣebḥan waha. Meȓa bnaḏem aqaṯ ḏ aṣebḥan aṭṭas, imken can yijjen axas iqbeȓ aḏ immeṯ. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Walakin neccin tuɣaneɣ ƹaḏ nƹeṣṣa Arebbi wami immuṯ xaneɣ Lmasiḥ. S manayenni isbeyyen-aneɣ-d Arebbi mecḥaȓ ḏaneɣ itexs.<verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Iḏen, aqaneɣ bariʼin ȓexxu s iḏammen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iḏammen netta ḏ ddem.</char></note> n Lmasiḥ, u labud zzayes iy ɣa nenjem zeg uɣḍab n Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Neccin nmeṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi s ȓmewṯ n Mmis wami tuɣaneɣ neccin ƹaḏ ḏ ȓƹaḏyan nnes. Ȓexxu wami kiḏes nmeṣȓaḥ, u labud zzayes iy ɣa nenjem s ṯuḏarṯ nnes! <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />War iǧi ɣir manaya waha, neccin nfarreḥ zi Arebbi s Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wenni iy ḏaneɣ isemṣȓaḥen akiḏes.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓfarq jar Siḏna Adam ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Iḏen, ṯban-d ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ɣar ddunect s yijjen n bnaḏem, <char style="it">iƹni Adam</char>. S ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nni iy ṯeǧa ȓmewṯ. Ssenni ṯnefreq ȓmewṯ x yiwḏan marra liʼanna iwḏan marra ƹṣan. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Aqa ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ tuɣa teǧa ḏi ddunect qbeȓ ma aḏ d ṯas ccariƹa. Walakin mani war ṯuwiḍ ca ccariƹa, Arebbi war ḏinni itḥisib bu ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Innama, zi zman n Adam aȓ zman n Musa ṯḥekkem ȓmewṯ <char style="it">x yiwḏan</char> uȓa x yinni war iƹṣin ca amecnaw ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ n Adam, u netta ḏ ȓmiṯal n bnaḏem iy d ɣa yasen.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Walakin ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ <char style="it">n Adam</char> war nzemmar at nmeṯṯel ak lhadiya <char style="it">n arḍa n Arebbi</char>. Cuf, ijjen n bnaḏem, <char style="it">netta ḏ Adam,</char> iƹṣa Arebbi yuwi-d ȓmewṯ i marra yiwḏan. Ȓexxu mecḥaȓ imɣar arḍa n Arebbi ḏ lhadiya iy d infeyyḍen x yiwḏan s arḍa n yijjen n bnaḏem nneɣni netta ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Cuf ƹaweḏ, lhadiya n Arebbi maci amecnaw min iweqƹen x ssabab n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ igga bnaḏem nni Adam. Liʼanna ȓḥukem iy d ṯuwi ijjen n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ netta ḏ lḥisab ḏ lƹiqab. Walakin s lhadiya-ya Arebbi isemṣȓaḥ akiḏes bnaḏem menbaƹd i waṭṭas n ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Iƹni, s ssabab n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nni n yijjen n bnaḏem ṯebḏa ȓmewṯ ṯḥekkem x yiwḏan s ssabab n bnaḏem nni. Ȓexxu s ssabab n yijjen n bnaḏem, iƹni s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, ḏ ṯuḏarṯ nettaṯ ṯḥekkem aṭṭas x yinni iqebbȓen arḍa imɣaren n Arebbi ḏ lhadiya iy ṯen isemṣȓaḥen akiḏes.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Iḏen ijjen n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ig igga ijjen n bnaḏem ṯuwi-d lḥisab ḏ lƹiqab i marra iwḏan. Amenni ijjen n baraʼa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lbaraʼa-ya iƹni ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wami itwaṣelleb ƹlaḥsab ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ n bnaḏem.</char></note> ig igga ijjen n bnaḏem yuwi-d ṣṣulḥ ḏ ṯuḏarṯ i marra iwḏan. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Liʼanna mammec iƹṣa Adam Arebbi yuwi-d ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ i waṭṭas n yiwḏan, amenni iṭaƹ Ƹisa i Arebbi ssenni meṣȓaḥen aṭṭas n yiwḏan ak Arebbi.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />U ccariƹa nettaṯ ṯuḏef-d ḥima aḏ kṯarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ. Walakin cḥaȓ ma kṯarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ, arḍa n Arebbi ikṯar ktar zzaysent. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />U mammec ṯeḥkem ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ṯuwi-d ȓmewṯ, amenni iy xaneɣ iḥkem arḍa wami ḏaneɣ isemṣȓaḥ Arebbi akiḏes yuwi-d ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda x ufus n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Netmetta s ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, nteddar s Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Iwa, min ɣa nini? Ma a nsiɣi ḏi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ ḥima aḏ ikṯar arḍa n Arebbi? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Lla, ƹemmarṣ! Neccin nemmuṯ-as i ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zaƹma, "Nemmuṯ i ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ" hiya ȓexxu wami numen zi Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa, ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ war ɣares bu jjheḏ xaneɣ. War ṯzemmar aḏaneɣ ṯḍarr. Neccin ȓexxu netwaȓa ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ belli nettaṯ ḏ ṯaƹeffant aṭṭas, war nzemmar ca azzayes nfareḥ uȓa aḏayes nƹic.</char></note> ixeṣṣa-yaneɣ ȓexxu war netsiɣi ca a nƹic ḏayes. <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Ma war ṯessinem ca kenniw? Neccin, wami netwaṭehhar s waman ḥima a niȓi ḏ ijjen ak Lmasiḥ, netwaṭehhar akiḏes ḥima a ncarec ḏi ȓmewṯ nnes. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Falihaḏa wami netwaṭehhar akiḏes s waman, iƹni netwanḍeȓ akiḏes ḏi ȓmewṯ. Mayemmi? Ḥima mammec d ikkar Lmasiḥ zi ȓmewṯ s lƹaḍama n Arebbi Babaṯneɣ, amenni uȓa ḏ neccin aqa a nƹic ḏeg yijjen n ṯuḏarṯ ḏ jḏiḏ.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Cuf, meȓa ncarec akiḏes ḏeg yijjen n ȓmewṯ am ṯenni iy igga netta, amenni ƹaweḏ iy kiḏes ɣa ncarec ḏeg yijjen n lqiyama am ṯenni iy igga netta. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Neccin nessen belli nnefs nneɣ tuɣa ṯeǧa qbeȓ, nettaṯ iƹni, twaṣelleb ak Lmasiḥ ḥima aḏ tbeṭṭeȓ nnefs nneɣ iccuren s ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ, bac war netɣimi ca ssa aȓ ṯsawent ƹaḏ ḏ isemɣan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isemɣan niṯni ḏ lƹabid. Ȓmaƹna ḏanita iƹni neccin ḏ lƹabid n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ.</char></note> n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Aqa wenni immuṯen ihna zi ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Fa meȓa nemmuṯ neccin ak Lmasiḥ, ntamen ƹaweḏ akiḏes neddar. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Neccin nessen qa Lmasiḥ ikkar-d zi ȓmewṯ, ƹemmarṣ aḏ immeṯ ƹaweḏ. War tɣimi ȓmewṯ axas ṯḥekkem. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Liʼanna wami immuṯ, immuṯ ijjen n ṯwaȓa waha i ȓebda i min iǧan ḏ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. Ṯuḏarṯ nnes iddar ȓexxu, iddar-it i Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ammu labud aḏ tḥessbem kenniw ixef nwem ṯemmuṯem-as i ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, ṯeddarem-as i Arebbi s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Falihaḏa ixeṣṣa war tejjim ca ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ aḏ teḥkem x ddat nwem iy ɣa ifnan ḥima war teggem ca array i ccehweṯ nnes. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />War tqeddameṯ uȓa ḏ ijjen n ṭṭarf zi ddat nwem i ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ aḏ tegg ccarr s ddat nwem. Qeddmeṯ ixef nwem i Arebbi am yiwḏan zaƹma iy d ikkaren zeg imettinen ɣar ṯuḏarṯ. Qeddmeṯ kuȓ ṭṭarf zi ddat nwem ḥima azzayes itwagg min iǧan nican. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Aqa ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ war ṯeqqim ca aḏ teḥkem xawem liʼanna war ṯeǧim ca swadday n ufus n ccariƹa, aqawem swadday n arḍa n Arebbi.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Min iǧan nican, neccin ḏ lƹibad nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Iwa neccin ma a neƹṣa Arebbi xmi aqaneɣ swadday n arḍa nnes war neǧi ca swadday n ufus n ccariƹa? Lla, ƹemmarṣ! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Ma war ṯessinem ca? Meȓa ṯsellmem ixef nwem i can yijjen ṯḏewȓem ḏ isemɣan ṯṭaƹam-as, ataf aḏ tḏewȓem ḏ isemɣan i wenni umi ṯṭaƹam. Imma aḏ tṭaƹem i ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ itawin ɣar ȓmewṯ, imma aḏ tṭaƹem i wenni iy kenniw ɣa yawin ɣar ṣṣulḥ akiḏes. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17-18" />Walakin a neḥmeḏ Arebbi! Waxxa ṯṭaƹem i ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ qbeȓ, ȓexxu ṯṭaƹam s wuȓawen nwem i useȓmeḏ nni iy kenniw issiwḍen. Ṯehnam zi ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, ṯḏewȓem ḏ isemɣan i min iǧan nican. <verse eid="ROM 6:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Nec ssawaȓeɣ akiḏwem s yijjen n wawaȓ ƹadi liʼanna iqseḥ x bnaḏem aḏ ifhem manaya. Qbeȓ tuɣa tqeddamem kuȓ ṭṭarf zi ddat nwem bac azzayes itwagg lfasad ḏ ccarr itemɣuren. Walakin ȓexxu tqeddameṯ ddat nwem aḏ texḏem min iǧan nican ḥima aḏ tiȓim ṯeṣfam.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Cuf, wami tuɣa ṯṭaƹam i ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, tuɣa ɣarwem lḥurriya aḏ trezzum war teggem min iǧan nican. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni, ṯimesȓayin nni ma ḏaysent can nnfaƹ minzi ȓexxu tseḏḥam? Walu, liʼanna ṯimesȓayin nni tawint ɣar ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ȓexxu ṯehnam zi ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, ṯṭaƹam i Arebbi. Man nnfaƹ iy zzayes ɣa ṯawim? Iƹni aḏ tiȓim ṯeṣfam u manayenni itawi ɣar tuḏarṯ n ȓebda. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Aqa axeǧes n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ netta ḏ ȓmewṯ, walakin lhadiya n Arebbi nettaṯ ḏ ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Netwafekk zi ccariƹa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Ay ayṯma, ssawaȓeɣ akiḏwem ṯessnem ccariƹa. Ma war ṯessinem illa ccariƹa ṯḥekkem x bnaḏem iy iddaren waha? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Maṯalan ḏi ccariƹa, ṯamɣarṯ ṯemȓec meȓa aryaz nnes aqaṯ ƹaḏ iddar, aqat x yiri nnes. Meȓa aryaz nnes immuṯ aqa twafekk zi lqanun n ȓemȓac. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />S manaya, meȓa ṯruḥ ɣar can yijjen nneɣni, aryaz nnes aqaṯ ƹaḏ iddar, ataf twaḥsab ṯezna. Walakin meȓa immuṯ uryaz nnes, ataf twafekk zi lqanun-a. Ȓexddenni meȓa ṯemȓec ak can uryaz nneɣni ataf war twiḥisib ca ṯezna.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Ay ayṯma, amenni iy ṯeǧam uȓa ḏ kenniw. Iƹni twafekkem zi ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> wami ṯemmuṯ ddat n Lmasiḥ, aqawem x yiri n yijjen nneɣni netta ḏ yiri n <char style="it">Lmasiḥ</char> iy d ikkaren zi ȓmewṯ, ḥima a narew ȓexḏayem ḏ ṯiṣebḥanin i Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Liʼanna qbeȓ wami tuɣa ntegg array i ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nneɣ, arnint ḏayneɣ ccehawaṯ ḏ ṯiƹeffanin ƹlaḥsab min ḏaneɣ ṯenna ccariƹa, xeddment ccehawaṯ nni ḏi ddat nneɣ uca ntarew ȓexḏayem itawin ɣar ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Walakin ȓexxu neccin netwafekk zi ccariƹa-ya iy ḏaneɣ iqqnen, nemmuṯ-as i manayenni. Neccin nƹebbeḏ s yijjen n ubriḏ ḏ jḏiḏ n Arruḥ n Arebbi, maci s nniḍam nni aqḏim iy yurin ḏi Lkitab.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ṯseḍhar-it-id ccariƹa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Iwa min ɣa nini? Ma ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> nettaṯ s yixef nnes ḏ ijjen n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ? Lla, ƹemmarṣ! Maƹlik ccariƹa war ṯeǧi, ataf war ssineɣ min ṯeƹna ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. Maƹlik war ḏayes ȓuṣiyeṯ nni &lt;War ƹecceq&gt;, ataf war ssineɣ min iƹna uƹeccaq. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ṯumma ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ṯufa ḏayi lfurṣa s ȓuṣiyeṯ-a, ṯarni ḏayi zi kuȓ nnuƹ n uƹeccaq iy iǧan liʼanna ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ bȓa ccariƹa axmi ṯemmuṯ. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Nec qbeȓ ma aḏ ssneɣ ccariƹa, tuɣayi ddareɣ. Walakin wami d ṯusa ȓuṣiyeṯ n Arebbi, ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ axmi ṯekkar-d zi ȓmewṯ uca nec axmi mmuṯeɣ. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Ṯumma ufiɣ ȓuṣiyeṯ nni iy d yusin aḏayi ṯuc ṯuḏarṯ, lla, qa nec ṯuwi-yayi ɣar ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Liʼanna ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ṯufa ḏayi lfurṣa s ȓuṣiyeṯ-a ṯecmeṯ-ayi u ƹaweḏ zzayes zi ȓuṣiyeṯ-a ṯneɣ-ayi.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />S manaya ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> ṯeṣfa, ȓuṣiyeṯ n Arebbi ṯeṣfa, ṯeṣȓaḥ, ṯeṣbaḥ.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ij umenɣi ɣar ḏaxeȓ n bnaḏem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Iwa, ma iḏweȓ min iṣebḥan ḏ ssabab iy zi ɣa mmṯeɣ nec? Lla, ƹemmarṣ! Lƹaks, ḏ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ iy iggin manayenni, ṯesxeddam min iṣebḥan ḥima aḏayi ṯneɣ. Mayemmi? Ḥima aḏ tesmeḍhar ixef nnes nettaṯ ḏ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. Ṯumma s <char style="it">lfurṣa n</char> ȓuṣiyeṯ-a ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ṯesmeḍhar-d bȓa ȓaḥedd mecḥaȓ iqbeḥ ccarr nnes.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Fa neccin nessen ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> zi Arebbi, walakin nec ḏ bnaḏem twammenzeɣ i ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />War sent tefhimeɣ ca i ȓexḏayem inu liʼanna nec war teggeɣ min xseɣ aṯ ggeɣ, teggeɣ min tƹiffiɣ. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />U xmi teggeɣ min war xseɣ ca aḏ ggeɣ, ataf wafqeɣ belli ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> ṯeṣbaḥ. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Ṯumma zi ssa aȓ ṯsawent ataf maci ḏ nec iteggen manaya, ḏ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nni iy ḏayi izeddɣen. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Nec ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant inu ssneɣ war ḏayes ṯezḏiɣ uȓa ḏ ijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ ḏ ṯaṣebḥant. Liʼanna rezzuɣ aḏ ggeɣ ṯimesȓayin ṯiṣebḥanin, walakin war zemmareɣ aṯent ggeɣ. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Ṯimesȓayin nni ṯiṣebḥanin iy texseɣ aṯent ggeɣ war ṯent teggeɣ ca; Lla, ccarr nni iy war texseɣ aṯ ggeɣ teggeɣ-ṯ. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Meȓa teggeɣ min war texseɣ, ataf nettaṯ ḏ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nni iy ḏayi izeddɣen; maci ḏ nec iteggen manayenni.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Falihaḏa nec ufiɣ ḏeg yixef inu ijjen n ṭṭabiƹa, iƹni xmi texseɣ aḏ ggeɣ can ṯmesȓayṯ ḏ ṯaṣebḥant, ufiɣ ḏinni ccarr yuḏes. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Liʼanna ḏi nnefs inu nec farḥeɣ s ccariƹa n Arebbi, <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />walakin tafeɣ ijjen n ṭṭabiƹa nneɣni ḏeg yixef inu ig itmenɣan ak min ɣari ḏi ȓaƹqeȓ inu. S ṭṭabiƹa-ya teqqen-ayi ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nni iy ḏayi izeddɣen ḏeg yixef inu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ inu nec! Wi ḏayi ɣa isnejmen zi ddat-a ṯanita n ȓmewṯ? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Tcekkareɣ Arebbi ƹlaḥsab Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">S manaya ḏi ȓaƹqeȓ inu nec ḏ ismeɣ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ismeɣ netta ḏ lƹabid.</char></note> n ccariƹa n Arebbi, nec ḏi ddat inu ḏ ismeɣ n ṭṭabiƹa n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Jjheḏ n Arruḥ n Arebbi ixeddmen ḏi ṯuḏarṯ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Iḏen fa ȓexxu, war iǧi bu lḥisab ḏ lƹiqab x yinni iǧan ḏ ijjen ak Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Liʼanna ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, ṭṭabiƹa n Arruḥ ig iticcen ṯuḏarṯ ṯfekk-icek-d zi ṭṭabiƹa n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ḏ ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Cuf, Arebbi igga min war ṯzemmar aḏ tegg ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char>, mayemmi? Ƹlaḥsab ḍḍuƹef n ddat nneɣ iy ḏas ikksen jjheḏ i ccariƹa. Arebbi, wami iy d issekk Mmis imeṯṯel-iṯ-iḏ am ddat n bnaḏem iƹṣan, issekk-iṯ-id ḏ lfidya x ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nneɣ. Ammu iḥaseb iƹaqeb ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ig iǧan ḏi ddat n bnaḏem <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />bac aḏ itwakemmeȓ min ṯxes zzayneɣ ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char>. Neccin, iƹni ḏ yinni ig igguren ḏeg ubriḏ n Arruḥ, war ntegg array i nnefs nneɣ.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Cuf, yinni itƹicen ƹlaḥsab ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nsen xeddmen s ȓxaḍar nsen ḏi ṯmesȓayin n ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nsen. Walakin yinni itƹicen ƹlaḥsab abriḏ n Arruḥ xeddmen s ȓxaḍar nsen ḏi ṯmesȓayin n Arruḥ. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Aqa yinni ixeddmen s ȓxaḍar nsen ḏi ṯmesȓayin n ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nsen ataf aḏ mmṯen. Walakin yinni ixeddmen s ȓxaḍar nsen ḏi ṯmesȓayin n Arruḥ ataf aḏ ddaren aɣarsen yiȓi ȓehna. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Aqa ȓxaḍar ixeddmen ḏi ṯmesȓayin n ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant n bnaḏem itƹarraḍ Arebbi. War iṭṭiƹi ca i ccariƹa n Arebbi, u ḏ ṣṣaḥ war izemmar ca. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />U yinni itṭaƹan i ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nsen war zemmaren ca aḏ sarḍan Arebbi.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Amma kenniw, meȓa izeddeɣ ḏaywem Arruḥ n Arebbi, ataf aḏ tƹicem x ubriḏ n Arruḥ ataf war teggem array i ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nwem. U wenni war ɣar iǧi Arruḥ n Lmasiḥ, war iǧi ca zi Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ṯumma Lmasiḥ meȓa aqaṯ ḏaywem, ddat nwem waxxa ṯemmuṯ s ssabab n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, arruḥ nwem iddar s ssabab n ṣṣulḥ. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Ṯumma meȓa izeddeɣ ḏaywem Arruḥ n Arebbi iy d isekkaren Ƹisa zi ȓmewṯ, ataf wenni iy d isekkaren Ƹisa zi ȓmewṯ aḏaywem d yarr ṯuḏarṯ uȓa ḏi ddat nwem ifennan iƹni s Arruḥ nnes iy ḏaywem izeddɣen.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />X manayenni ay ayṯma, itxeṣṣa-yaneɣ a negg lwajib, walakin maci ḥima a negg array i ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nneɣ. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Liʼanna kenniw meȓa teggem array i ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nwem, aḏ temmṯem. Meȓa ṯneqqem ȓefƹayer n ddat nwem s Arruḥ n Arebbi, aḏ teddarem. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />U yinni iḏeffaren Arruḥ n Arebbi, ḏ yinni iy iǧan ḏ ṯarwa n Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Liʼanna Arruḥ iy ḏawem d immucen war kenniw itarri ca ḏ isemɣan ḥima aḏ tƹicem ƹaweḏ ḏi ṯiggwḏi; Lla, immuc-awem-d Arruḥ iqeddsen ḥima aḏ tiȓim ḏ ṯarwa n Arebbi. S Arruḥ nni iy ɣa nȓaɣa: Abba, iƹni, a Baba inu. <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Iƹni Arruḥ n Arebbi s yixef nnes ig iṣaḥḥen ḏi arruḥ nneɣ belli neccin ḏ ṯarwa n Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />U neccin meȓa aqaneɣ ḏ ṯarwa n Arebbi, ataf a nwareṯ. Iƹni a nwareṯ zi Arebbi, a nwareṯ ak Lmasiḥ. Walakin ixeṣṣa-yaneɣ a ncarec akiḏes ḏeg uƹeddeb nnes ḥima a ncarec akiḏes ƹaweḏ ḏi lƹaḍama nnes.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lƹaḍama iy ḏaneɣ itrajan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Cuf, nec twaȓiɣ aƹeddeb-a iy xaneɣ itekken ḏi ddunect-a netta war iǧi ḏ walu bac aḏ imeṯṯel ak lƹaḍama iy ḏaneɣ d ɣa imeḍharen. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Aqa marra min d itwaxeȓqen ḏaysen mezȓi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mezȓi qqaren-ṯ i imezȓi.</char></note> ḏ ameqqran trajan aḏ ẓren ṯsaƹƹat nni iy ḏi d ɣa banen ṯarwa n Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Liʼanna marra min d itwaxeȓqen nṣaben s lfacal. Walakin maci s array nsen, s array n wenni iy ṯen iṣaben. U manayenni ḏi lʼamal. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Lʼamal, iƹni, belli marra min d itwaxeȓqen aḏ twafekken zi lfana n ȓmewṯ, aḏ carcen ḏi lḥurriya n lƹaḍama iy ɣarsen ɣar ṯarwa n Arebbi.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Cuf, neccin nessen belli marra min d itwaxeȓqen aqaṯen aȓ nhara ƹaḏ tnezbaren amecnaw ṯamɣarṯ nni iy ḏi iǧa ȓeḥriq n ṯarwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />U maci niṯni waha, uȓa ḏ neccin umi immuc Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏ amezwaru nnehhek ḏeg yixef nneɣ. Ḏayneɣ mezȓi, neccin netraja zi Arebbi aḏ d isbeyyen belli neccin ḏ ṯarwa nnes, iƹni aḏ ifekk ddat nneɣ. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Aqa ḏi mezȓi-ya neccin nenjem. Cuf, meȓa ṣafi nufa mezȓi nni iy nrezzu, ataf ṣafi war ḏayneɣ itiȓi bu mezȓi ƹaḏ. Ma a nraja ƹaḏ mezȓi nni meȓa ṣafi nufi-ṯ? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Lla, walakin meȓa ƹaḏ war ṯ nufi ca ataf aṯ nraja s ṣṣbar.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Fa ammu Arruḥ iqeddsen itƹawan-aneɣ ḏi ḍḍuƹef nneɣ. Neccin war nessin ca mliḥ minxef ɣa neẓẓaǧ, walakin Arruḥ iqeddsen s yixef nnes itṭalab-as i Arebbi x ssabab nneɣ s unhak war itsemiƹen. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Ṯumma Arebbi netta itwaȓan min iǧan ḏeg wuȓawen n bnaḏem, issen min itexs Arruḥ iqeddsen. Liʼanna Arruḥ ƹlaḥsab ȓxaḍar n Arebbi itṭalab x ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Fa neccin nessen belli marra min itewqiƹen qaƹ itarra-ṯ Arebbi ḏ ttisir i yinni iy ṯ itexsen, iƹni ḏ yinni umi iy d iȓaɣa ƹlaḥsab lɣaraḍ nnes. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Liʼanna yinni iy tuɣa issen-iṯen zi qbeȓ, izemmem-iṯen zi qbeȓ ḥima aḏ iȓin x ṣṣifeṯ n Mmis aḏ iȓin am netta. Ammu aḏ yiȓi netta ḏ Mmis amenzu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amenzu netta ḏ ifxeddi. Qqaren-ṯ i uḥenjir iy d ɣa ixeȓqen ḏ amezwaru.</char></note> n waṭṭas n ayṯmas. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Ṯumma yinni iy tuɣa izemmem zi qbeȓ, iȓaɣa-d xasen. Ṯumma yinni umi d iȓaɣa, isemṣȓaḥ-iṯen akiḏes. Ṯumma yinni isemṣȓaḥ akiḏes, yuca-asen amcan ḏi lƹaḍama nnes.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓemḥibbeṯ n Arebbi ḏi Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Iwa, min ɣa nini menbaƹd i marra manaya? Meȓa Arebbi aqaṯ akiḏneɣ, uw izemmaren aḏ yiȓi ḍed nneɣ? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" /><char style="it">Siḏi Arebbi</char> war isƹizz ca Mmis xaneɣ, iqeddem-iṯ i ȓmewṯ xaneɣ marra. Ma aḏ teqqim can ȓḥajeṯ war ḏaneɣ-t iticc ca akiḏes? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Wi izemmaren aḏ itahem yinni iy ixḍar Arebbi? <char style="it">Uȓa ḏ ijjen!</char> Arebbi s yixef nnes netta ig isemṣȓaḥen akiḏes iwḏan. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Wi izemmaren axasen iḥkem? <char style="it">Uȓa ḏ ijjen!</char> Liʼanna netta Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ig immuṯen. U ktar, ikkar-d zi ȓmewṯ u ḏ netta iy iǧan x ufusi n Arebbi, itcafaƹ ḏayneɣ. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Wi ḏaneɣ ɣa iƹezȓen zi ȓemḥibbeṯ n Lmasiḥ? Uȓa ḏ ijjen! Ȓa ḏ azeyyar, ȓa ḏ tamara, ȓa ḏ aƹeddeb, ȓa ḏ buheyyuf, ȓa ḏ ṯuƹaryant, ȓa ḏ lxaṭar, uȓa ḏ ssif. <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Mammec iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">&lt;Neccin x ssabab nnec cek netwajah ȓmewṯ nhar ikmaȓ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">Neccin netwaḥsab amecnaw iḥuȓiyen umi ɣa ɣarṣen.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Walakin ḏi marra manaya neccin netwaḥsab ktar zi lʼabṭal x ufus n wenni iy ḏaneɣ ixsen. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38-39" />Aqa nec metʼakked belli uȓa ḏ ijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ zi min d itwaxeȓqen war ṯzemmar aḏaneɣ ṯeƹzeȓ zi ȓemḥibbeṯ n Arebbi iy d imeḍharen ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ: ȓa ḏ ȓmewṯ, ȓa ḏ ṯuḏarṯ, ȓa ḏ lmalaʼikaṯ, ȓa ḏ ccayaṭin, ȓa ḏ jnun, ȓa ḏ min iǧan ȓexxu, ȓa ḏ min d ɣa yasen, ȓa ḏ min yuƹȓan, ȓa ḏ min yuǧɣen, uȓa ḏ ca n ȓḥajeṯ nneɣni.<verse eid="ROM 8:38-39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itxeyyaq x lʼumma n Siḏna Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ssawaȓeɣ ȓḥaqq ḏi Lmasiḥ war iǧi bu ḏ ixarriqen. Ȓaƹqeȓ inu u ḏ Arruḥ iqeddsen aḏayi ṣaḥḥen min ɣa iniɣ. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2-3" />Iƹni, isḥerreq-ayi ijjen n ȓeḥriq aṭṭas ḏeg wuȓ inu war itkemmiȓ ca x ssabab n ȓqum inu, iƹni yinni iǧan zi lʼumma inu. Maƹlik zemmareɣ nec, aḏ twaneƹȓeɣ aḏ twaḥarrmeɣ zi Lmasiḥ bac niṯni war twaneƹƹiȓen ca war twaḥarrimen ca zi Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ROM 9:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Niṯni ḏ Ayṯ-Israʼil, itbenna-ṯen Siḏi Arebbi. Ismeḍhar-asen-d lƹaḍama nnes, iƹaheḏ-iṯen, yuca-asen ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> ḏ lƹibada, iwƹeḏ-iṯen. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Usin-d zi ssalaf ṣṣaliḥin, u zeg uẓwer nsen iy d yusa Lmasiḥ ḏ ddat ḏ bnaḏem. Arebbi itwaḥmeḏ i ȓebda, wenni iḥekkmen x marra. Amin.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Walakin, awaȓ n Arebbi ma war injiḥ ca? Lla, injeḥ! Fa maci Ayṯ-Israʼil qaƹ ig iǧan ḏ israʼiliyen ḏ ṣṣaḥ. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Ƹaweḏ war iǧi marra ṯarwa iy d ikkin zi Brahim ḏ ṯarwa nnes n ṣṣaḥ. <char style="it">Inna-as Arebbi:</char> &lt;Ḏ ṯarwa nnec iy d ɣa iffɣen zi <char style="it">mmic</char> Isḥaq iy ɣa itwaḥessben.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Manaya ixes aḏ yini ṯarwa n Arebbi ḏ ṣṣaḥ twaḥessben zi ṯarwa n ȓƹaheḏ, maci zi ṯarwa n bnaḏem. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Liʼanna ȓƹaheḏ-a iy ḏas yuca Arebbi i Brahim ḏ wanita, inna: &lt;Aḏ d ƹeqbeɣ aseggwas iy d ɣa yasen am ȓweqṯ-a, aḏ afeɣ ij uḥenjir ɣar Sara.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />War iǧi bu manayenni waha. Rafiqa ṯeysi aƹeddis ɣares <char style="it">acniwen</char>, babaṯsen netta ḏ jeddiṯneɣ Isḥaq. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11-12" />Ṯumma ikkar Arebbi inna-as i Rafiqa qa ameqqran aḏ yiȓi ḏ axeddam ɣar umezyan. Iȓaɣa-yas-d Arebbi i netta waha, niṯni war ggin walu. Tuɣa ƹaḏ war d xȓiqen ca ƹaḏ war ggin ȓxir war ggin ccarr, walakin <char style="it">Siḏi Arebbi</char> ixḍar ijjen zzaysen ismeḍhar-d ȓxaḍar nnes iy ɣa yiȓin. <verse eid="ROM 9:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Mammec iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Ḥibbeɣ Yaƹqub, seḥqareɣ Ƹasu.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Min ɣa nini x manaya? Ma Arebbi iḍeǧem? Lla, ƹemmarṣ! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Qa Arebbi inna-as i Musa: &lt;Aḏ reḥmeɣ wenni xseɣ, aḏ ḥinneɣ x wenni xseɣ.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Manaya war iǧi ca zi ȓxeḏmeṯ n bnaḏem niɣ zi min itexs, manaya aqaṯ zi Arebbi wenni ireḥḥmen. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Aqa iqqar-as Lkitab i Firƹun: &lt;Ggiɣ-ac ḏ azeǧiḏ ḥima aḏayek d smeḍhareɣ jjheḏ inu, ḥima aḏ itwassen yisem inu ḏi marra ddunect.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Falihaḏa Arebbi ireḥḥem wenni ixes, isɣannan wenni ixes.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aɣḍab n Arebbi ḏ arraḥmeṯ nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Iwa a bnaḏem, ma aḏayi ṯiniḏ mayemmi ƹaḏ iy ḏaneɣ itḥasab Arebbi? <char style="it">Ma aḏayi ṯiniḏ</char> ug izemmaren aḏ imɣannen ak min ixes netta? <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" /><char style="it">Cuf</char> a bnaḏem, min ṯeƹniḏ cek bac ṯzemmareḏ aḏ tarreḏ awaȓ x Arebbi? Ma zemmaren aḏ inin iɣerrafen i wenni iy ṯen iṣenƹen, Mayemmi ḏaneɣ ṯeggiḏ ammu? <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Ma war ɣares bu ȓḥaqq ɣar lemƹallem aḏ isexḏem ṯȓaxṯ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯȓaxṯ nettaṯ ḏ iḏeqqi.</char></note> mammec ixes, iƹni aḏ igg zeg yijjen n ȓƹajneṯ iḏeqqi ijjen n uɣerraf i min iṣebḥan, aḏ igg ijjen i min iƹuffnen?<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Amenni ig igga Arebbi. Wami ixes aḏ d ismeḍhar aɣḍab nnes aḏ d isbeyyen jjheḏ iy ɣares, iṣebbar aṭṭas x <char style="it">yinni iy xef iɣḍeb</char> iƹni iɣerrafen nni wejḏen aḏ twarzen. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23-24" />Igga amenni liʼanna ixes aḏ ismeḍhar lƹaḍama nnes imɣaren x yina ig irḥem iƹni iɣerrafen-a ig isewjeḏ zi qbeȓ i lƹaḍama, iƹni ḏ neccin. Iȓaɣa-yaneɣ-d i neccin iy d yusin zi Ayṯ-Israʼil uȓa ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ROM 9:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Mammec iqqar Arebbi ḏi Lkitab n nnabi Hucaƹ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">&lt;Yinni tuɣa war iǧin ca ḏ ccaƹb inu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">asen ȓaɣiɣ a ccaƹb inu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Ṯenni tuɣa war iƹizzen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">as ȓaɣiɣ a ṯamƹizzit inu.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />U ḏeg umcan nni wenni mani ḏasen inna Arebbi: Kenniw war ṯeǧim ca ḏ ccaƹb inu, ḏinni iy ḏasen ɣa ȓaɣan a ṯarwa n Arebbi iddaren.<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Fa nnabi Icaƹya iȓaɣa netta x Ayṯ-Israʼil inna: &lt;Waxxa lƹadad n Ayṯ-Israʼil igga am yijḏi n ȓebḥar, ḏrus zzaysen iy ɣa inejmen. <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Aqa Siḏi Arebbi war itƹeṭṭiȓ ca aḏ ixḏem ḏi ddunect-a awaȓ ig inna.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Ammu ig inna nnabi Icaƹya zi qbeȓ: &lt;Maƹlik war iǧi ḏ Siḏi Arebbi Lƹalamin iy iḥefḍen can ddurriṯ nneɣ, iȓi iwqeƹ-aneɣ amecnaw min iweqƹen i ṯendint n Sadum ḏ ṯendint n Ƹamura.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayṯ-Israʼil tagin aḏ amnen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Iwa, min ɣa nini? Yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil tuɣa war rezzun ca ṣṣulḥ ak Arebbi, walakin ufin-ṯ wami umnen. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Ayṯ-Israʼil wami rezzun ijjen n ccariƹa iticcen ṣṣulḥ ak Arebbi, war ufin ca ccariƹa nni. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Mayemmi? Liʼanna tuɣa rezzun ṣṣulḥ nni s ȓexḏayem nsen waha bȓa ma aḏ amnen. Nqeȓḍen ḏeg uzru nni iy ḏi tneqȓaḍen yiwḏan. <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Mammec iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">&lt;Aqa ggiɣ ḏi ṯendint n Lquds</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ij n ttirceṯ iy ḏi tenqȓaḍen yiwḏan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ḏ yijjen n uzru iy ṯen iɣeṭṭȓen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Wenni iy zzayes ɣa yamnen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ƹemmarṣ aṯ xeyybeɣ.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />
    <char style="it">Inna-asen Bulus:</char> Ay ayṯma, mecḥaȓ tmenniɣ s wuȓ inu tẓaǧiɣ i Arebbi aḏ tenjem lʼumma inu. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Nec cehhḏeɣ xasen rezzun aḏ ggen lwajib ak Arebbi, walakin war ssinen ca aḏ ggen lwajib. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Wami war ssinen ca mammec igga Arebbi isemṣȓaḥ akiḏes bnaḏem, kkaren niṯni ḏfaren abriḏ nsen nniṯ war qbiȓen ca abriḏ n Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Li'anna Lmasiḥ ḏayes ḏi netta iy ṯkemmeȓ ccariƹa ḥima marra wi zzayes ɣa yamnen aḏ imeṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Marra iwḏan zemmaren aḏ nejmen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Cuf, mammec iǧa ubriḏ n ṣṣulḥ ƹlaḥsab ccariƹa? Yura xas Musa inna: Marra wi ɣa ixeḏmen s ṯmesȓayin-a ṯina, ataf azzaysent iƹic. <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Walakin min iqqar Lkitab x wenni irezzun aḏ imeṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi azzayes yamen? Iqqar: War qqar ca ḏeg wuȓ nnec: Min iƹna wi ɣa igaƹƹḏen ɣar ujenna (iƹni bac aḏ d isehwa Lmasiḥ)? <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Niɣ: Min iƹna wi ɣa ihwan ɣar ȓaǧeɣ bȓa ȓaḥedd (iƹni bac aḏ d yarr Lmasiḥ zeg yinni immuṯen)? <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Iwa min iqqar Lkitab? Iqqar: &lt;Awaȓ-a yuḏes i cek, aqaṯ ḏeg uqemmum nnec ḏ wuȓ nnec.&gt; Iƹni awaȓ-a netta ḏ lʼiman iy zi netḥeddaṯ. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Qa meȓa ṯcehḏeḏ s uqemmum nnec illa Ƹisa ḏ Siḏic, meȓa ṯumneḏ s wuȓ nnec illa Arebbi isekkar-iṯ-iḏ zi ȓmewṯ, ataf aḏ tnejmeḏ. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Liʼanna s wuȓ nnec cek tamneḏ, ac isemṣȓaḥ Arebbi akiḏes. U s uqemmum nnec cek ṯcehhḏeḏ, cek ṯnejmeḏ. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Aqa Lkitab iqqar: &lt;Marra wenni zzayes ɣa yamnen war ṯ itxiyyib ca.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Liʼanna war ḏinni bu ȓfarq jar israʼiliyen ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil minzi Siḏi Arebbi ḏ ijjen, aqaṯ xaneɣ marra. Itenfeyyaḍ-d ȓxir nnes x marra wenni xas itȓaɣan. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Aqa &lt;Marra wenni iy ɣa iȓaɣan s yisem n Siḏi Arebbi ataf aḏ injem.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xzar Lkitab n nnabi Waʼil 2:32.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Iḏen, mammec ɣa ggen aḏ ȓaɣan x wenni iy zi war yuminen ca? Mammec ɣa ggen aḏ amnen zeg wenni umi war xas sȓin ca? Mammec ɣa ggen axas sȓen meȓa war ḏasen itḥeddiṯ ḥadd? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />U mammec ɣa ggen aḏ ḥeddṯen meȓa war ḏasen d issekk ḥadd? Aqa iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Mecḥaȓ ṣebḥan iḍaren n yinni itbeccaren s Lʼinjil.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Lʼinjil walakin war ṯ qbiȓen ca marra iwḏan. Aqa min iqqar nnabi Icaƹya <char style="it">zi zman</char>: &lt;A Siḏi Arebbi, wi yumnen s minzi netbeccar?&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Falihaḏa, lʼiman itas-d zi min netsȓa, u min ntesȓa netta ḏ awaȓ n Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Walakin nec tseqsiɣ, Ma war sȓin ca? Wah, sȓin. <char style="it">Aqa min iqqar Lkitab</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">&lt;Ḏi marra ṯamurṯ iffeɣ-d ṣṣut nsen,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iƹni, ṣṣut n yinni itbeccaren.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">awaȓen nsen uwḍen aȓ ȓaḥedd n ddunect.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Ƹaweḏ nec tseqsiɣ, Ayṯ-Israʼil ma war fhimen ca? Ḏ amezwaru inna-asen Musa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;Akenniw jjeɣ aḏ tḥesḏem yinni war iǧin ca ḏ lʼumma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">akenniw sƹeṣṣbeɣ s yijjen n lʼumma war ifehhmen.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Menbaƹd izƹem nnabi Icaƹya inna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;Yinni war xafi irezzun ca ufin-ayi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">smeḍhareɣ-d ixef inu i yinni war xafi itseqsin.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Walakin x Ayṯ-Israʼil iqqar:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">&lt;Nec ifassen inu ḍeȓqeɣ-ṯen-d nhar ikmaȓ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">ɣar yij n ccaƹb iƹṣan, ḏaysen ṯaɣennant.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Arebbi, ma inkar Ayṯ-Israʼil?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Iwa tseqsiɣ nec, Arebbi ma inkar ccaƹb nnes? Lla, ƹemmarṣ! Nec s yixef inu ḏ aʼisraʼili, zi ddurriṯ n Brahim zi Ayṯ-Benyamin. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Arebbi war inkar ca ccaƹb nnes tuɣa issen-iṯen zi qbeȓ. Ma war ṯessinem ca kenniw min iqqar Lkitab x nnabi Ilyas? Wami iceṯca ɣar Arebbi zi Ayṯ-Israʼil inna-as: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />&lt;A Siḏi Arebbi! Nɣin lʼanbiya, heḏmen imucan mani ḏac netqeddam dbiḥaṯ. Ȓexxu qqimeɣ ɣir nec waḥḏi rezzun aḏayi nɣen.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Iwa minzi xas yarra Arebbi? Inna-as: &lt;Jjiɣ sebƹa aȓaf n iryazen i yixef inu war rkiƹen ca i lʼaṣnam nni umi qqaren Baƹl!&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Iḏen uȓa ḏi zman-a iy ḏi neǧa, qa ḏa ȓebƹaḍ ixḍar-iṯen Arebbi s arḍa nnes. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Meȓa <char style="it">ixḍar-iṯen</char> s arḍa nnes, ataf ȓexxu war iǧi ca s lḥasanaṯ nsen. Meȓa maci amenni, ataf arḍa war itiȓi bu ḏ arḍa.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Iḏen, mixef rezzun Ayṯ-Israʼil war ṯ ufin ca, yinni itwaxḍaren ufin-ṯ. Yinni iqqimen, uȓawen nsen twaqsḥen. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Iwa mammec iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">&lt;Yuca-asen Arebbi ȓeqfaȓeṯ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">ṯiṭṭawin war twiȓint,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">imejjan war tesȓin aȓ nhar n yiḍa.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Iqqar nnabi Dawed:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">&lt;Aḏ iḏweȓ ȓƹiḏ nsen ḏ ṯaxcebṯ ḏ lfexx,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">ḏ azru iy ḏi tneqȓaḍen axas ccen aƹmuḏ.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Aḏ ḍarɣȓent ṯiṭṭawin nsen ḥima war twiȓint,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">aḏ iȓin iƹurar nsen ȓebda ḏ imaqewsen.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aḏ nejmen uȓa ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Iwa tseqsiɣ, Ayṯ-Israʼil ma ṣafi nqeȓḍen wḍan? Lla, ƹemmarṣ! Lƹaks, s ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ-a n Ayṯ-Israʼil isenjem Arebbi yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil bac aḏ tekkar lɣira ḏi Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ȓexxu ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nni iy ggin Ayṯ-Israʼil meȓa ṯuwi-d lbaraka ḏ ṯameqqrant i ddunect-a, u ƹaweḏ weṭṭu nni iy ggin meȓa yuwi-d lbaraka ḏ ṯameqqrant i yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil, mecḥaȓ ɣa ṯarni lbaraka xmi d ɣa ḏewȓen ɣar ubriḏ?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Fa nec qqareɣ-awem manaya i kenniw war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. Nec ḏ arrasul ɣar yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil, nec ȓxeḏmeṯ inu ḥessbeɣ-t ɣares ijjen n ccan imɣar. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Rezzuɣ aḏ snekkareɣ lɣira ḏeg ayṯma israʼiliyen ḥima aḏ snejmeɣ ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Aqa wami xasen yuzzeȓ Arebbi, isemṣȓaḥ netta ddunect-a akiḏes. Ƹaweḏ xmi ṯen ɣa iqbeȓ, aḏ tiȓi am ṯuḏarṯ i yinni immuṯen! <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Meȓa ṯqerrṣeḏ cwayt zeg urecṯi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arecṯi iƹni netta ḏ ariyṯi.</char></note> iṣfan ṯqeddmeḏ-ṯ i Arebbi, ataf aḏ yiȓi amenni iṣfa urecṯi nni amen-ikmaȓ. U meȓa aḏ iȓin iẓewran n ṯcejjarṯ ṣfan, ataf aḏ iȓin uȓa ḏ ȓefruƹ, <char style="it">iƹni ṯiseḍwin</char>.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Cuf, ȓebƹaḍ n ȓefruƹ <char style="it">iƹni ṯiseḍwin</char> twaqessent zi ṯzitunt, ssenni cek ṯetwaȓeqqmeḏ ḏeg umcan nsent jar ṯinni iqqimen waxxa cek ḏ azemmur, ṯcarrceḏ ḏeg iẓewran n ṯzitunt ṯeddareḏ zzaysen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lʼaya-ya ȓmaƹna nnes ȓebƹaḍ n ṯseḍwin n ṯzitunt twaqessent, ssenni ḏeg umcan nsent twaȓeqqment ȓebƹaḍ n ṯseḍwin n uzemmur. Maci ṯqess ṯzitunt qaƹ; Lla, qessent ȓebƹaḍ n ṯseḍwin nnes waha.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Walakin war tsemɣar ca ixef nnec x ȓefruƹ nni itwaqessen. Mayemmi? War tettu ca belli ḏ iẓewran nni iy cek iysin, war iǧi bu ḏ cek iy ṯen iysin.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Iḏen, imken cek aḏ tiniḏ qa ṯiseḍwin twaqessent bac nec aḏ twaȓeqqmeɣ ḏeg umcan nsent. <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Wah, niṯenti twaqessent ssenni wami war uminent ca; cek ṯeqqimeḏ ḏinni wami ṯumneḏ. Walakin war tsemɣar ca ixef nnec; Lla, ggweḏ! <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Iwa, meȓa Arebbi tuɣa war iḥinn ca ḏi ȓefruƹ n lʼaṣel, uȓa ḏ cek war ḏayek itḥinni ca.<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Iḏen xzar mecḥaȓ iṣbeḥ Arebbi mecḥaȓ iy iqseḥ. Iqseḥ x yinni iwḍan; iṣbeḥ akiḏec cek iƹni meȓa ṯeqqimeḏ ḏi ȓxir nnes. Meȓa lla ataf aḏ twaqesseḏ uȓa ḏ cek. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />U meȓa war qqimen ca israʼiliyen x lkufer nsen, uȓa ḏ niṯni aṯen iȓeqqem Arebbi liʼanna ɣares jjheḏ netta iy zi ṯen ɣa iȓeqqem ƹaweḏ. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Cuf, cek twaqesseḏ zeg uzemmur iƹni ṭṭabiƹa nnec, ssenni twaȓeqqmeḏ ḏi ṯzitunt iƹni maci ṭṭabiƹa nnec. U niṯenti, mecḥaȓ ihwen aḏ twaȓeqqment iƹni ṯiseḍwin n ṯzitunt aḏ twaƹeqbent ɣar lʼaṣel nsent.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arraḥmeṯ n Arebbi x marra ddunect</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Ay ayṯma, ḥima war ḏawem itiȓi ca ttakebbur rezzuɣ aḏ tfehmem ṯamesȓayṯ-a ṯanita inuffaren, iƹni Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏaysen ijjen n ṯɣennant war tɣimi ca i ȓebda. Aḏ teqqim aȓ ɣa ikemmeȓ lƹadad nni n ȓmuminin <char style="it">iy ɣa inejmen</char> zeg yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Amenni iy ɣa nejmen marra Ayṯ-Israʼil mammec iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">&lt;Zi Lquds iy d ɣa yas wenni iy ṯen ɣa isnejmen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">aḏ isbeƹƹeḏ ccarr x ṯarwa n Yaƹqub.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Aḏ yiȓi ḏ wa ḏ ȓƹaheḏ inu akiḏsen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">xmi xasen ɣa mḥiɣ ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />S ssabab n Lʼinjil, israʼiliyen ḏ ȓaƹḏu ƹlaḥsab kenniw. Walakin s ssabab minzi twaxḍaren, niṯni ḏ imƹizzen ƹlaḥsab ssalaf ṣṣaliḥin. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Liʼanna Arebbi war ineddem ca x min iticc niɣ x min itixḍar. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Cuf, ḏi ȓweqṯ nni iƹḏun tuɣa kenniw ṯƹeṣṣam Arebbi, irḥem-ikenniw ȓexxu s ssabab n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nni n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Amenni uȓa ḏ niṯni wami ƹṣan Arebbi ȓexxu, aṯen irḥem mammec iy kenniw irḥem. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Liʼanna netta Arebbi yarra iwḏan marra ḏ imeḥbas n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ḥima aṯen irḥem marra iḏsen.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Mecḥaȓ imɣar wagȓa n ȓefhameṯ ḏ ṯusna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯusna nettaṯ ḏ lmaƹrifa.</char></note> n Arebbi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">War twacerrḥen lʼaḥkam nnes,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">war twafehhmen ibriḏen nnes.<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Wig issnen ȓaƹqeȓ n Siḏi Arebbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">niɣ wi kis imcawaren?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Wi ḏas yucin can ȓḥajeṯ ḏ amezwaru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">bac netta aḏas-t-iḏ yarr?<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Aqa marra yusa-d ikka-d zzayes, kulci nnes.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">Aɣares ṯiȓi lƹaḍama i netta i ȓebda. Amin.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Ṯuḏarṯ n jḏiḏ x ufus n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Iḏen fa ay ayṯma, s arraḥmeṯ n Arebbi tcejjaƹeɣ-kenniw aḏ tqeddmem ixef nwem i Arebbi amecnaw ijjen n dbiḥeṯ ṯeddar, ḏ ṯamqeddest, axas yarḍa netta. Manaya ḏ lwajib n lƹibada xawem. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />War teggem ca min teggen yiwḏan ḏi ȓweqṯ-a ṯanita. Itxeṣṣa aɣarwem yiȓi ijjen n ȓaƹqeȓ ḏ jḏiḏ ḥima aḏ twabeddȓem, ssenni aḏ tessnem kenniw min ixes Arebbi, iƹni min iṣebḥan ḏ min ḏas iteƹjiben war ḏayes bu uxeṭṭi.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Fa s lbaraka iy ḏayi yuca Arebbi qqareɣ i mkuȓ ijjen zzaywem: War ḥesseb ca ixef nnec ktar zi min ṯeƹniḏ. Cek fekkar s ȓaƹqeȓ nnec ƹlaḥsab mecḥaȓ n lʼiman iy ḏac yuca Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Liʼanna ddat ḏayes aṭṭas n ṭrufaṯ, mkuȓ ṭṭarf ixeddem ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Amenni iy neǧa uȓa ḏ neccin. Waxxa neccin aṭṭas iy iḏneɣ aqaneɣ marra iḏneɣ ḏ ijjen n ddat ḏi Lmasiḥ, kuȓ ṭṭarf iteḥḏaja unneɣni. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Ƹlaḥsab lbaraka iy ḏaneɣ immucen ɣarneɣ neccin lqudraṯ, kuȓ lqudra war tcibbih ca ḏi ṯenneɣni. Ijjen meȓa yuca-as Arebbi lwaḥi, u labud aḏ isexḏem lqudra-ya ƹlaḥsab lʼiman nnes. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Ijjen meȓa itsexxar, u labud aḏ isexxar. Ijjen meȓa iseȓmaḏ, u labud aḏ iseȓmeḏ. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Ijjen meȓa itcejjaƹ, u labud aḏ icejjeƹ. Ijjen meȓa itṣeddaq, u labud aḏ yiȓi ḏ asexxay. Ijjen meȓa itraya, u labud aḏ iray s wuȓ nnes. Ijjen meȓa ireḥḥem, u labud aḏ irḥem s ȓefraḥeṯ nnes.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mammec itxeṣṣa aḏ iƹic ȓmumen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Ȓemḥibbeṯ itxeṣṣa aḏ tiȓi bȓa nnifaq. Ƹiffeṯ min iǧan ḏ ccarr, ṭṭfeṯ ḏi min iǧan ḏ ȓxir. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Xseṯ ayawya am ṯawmat. Weqqareṯ ayawya ktar zi jjheḏ. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Ḥawȓeṯ war teƹgizem ca. Xeḏmeṯ i Siḏi Arebbi s wuȓ ḏ arruḥ. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Farḥeṯ ḏi lʼamal. Ṣbareṯ x tamara. Dawwmeṯ x ṯẓaǧiṯ. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Ƹawneṯ ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin yinni iteḥḏajen. Reḥḥbeṯ x yinni itsafaren.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Barkeṯ i yinni kenniw itƹeddaben, barkeṯ war ṯen neƹƹȓem ca. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Farḥeṯ ak yinni ifarrḥen, truṯ ak yinni itrun. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Ƹiceṯ ag wayawya ḏi ȓehna. War semɣareṯ ca ixef nwem, mƹacareṯ ag ipubriṯen. War tarraṯ ca ixef nwem ḏ imiɣisen.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />War tarram ca ccarr s ccarr. Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem bac aḏ teḥtarmem marra iwḏan ḏi min teggem. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Ƹlaḥsab kenniw, meȓa mumken ggeṯ aḏ tiȓim ḏi ȓehna ak yiwḏan marra. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Ay imƹizzen inu, war tentaqamem zi ḥadd, lƹiqab jjem-ṯ i Arebbi. Aqa Lkitab iqqar: &lt;Ḏ nec ig itentaqamen, ḏ nec iy itxeǧasen, iqqar-it Siḏi Arebbi.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Lƹaks: Ȓaƹḏu nnec meȓa iǧuz, uc-as aḏ icc. Meȓa iffuḏ, uc-as aḏ isew. U mayemmi? Meȓa ṯeggiḏ-as ammu, axmi ṯserɣeḏ-as ȓefḥam x uzeǧif nnes. <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />War tejja ca ccarr ac iɣȓeb, ḏ cek iy ɣa iɣeȓben ccarr s ȓxir.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Lwajib nneɣ ƹlaḥsab ȓmexzen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Labud aḏ iṭaƹ kuȓ ijjen i ṣḥab n ȓmexzen liʼanna war iǧi bu ȓmexzen illa wenni d ikkin zi Arebbi. U yinni iḥekkmen ḏ Arebbi iy ṯen iggin. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />X manaya wi itƹarraḍen i ȓmexzen, itƹarraḍ i min igga Arebbi. U yinni ḏasen itƹarraḍen aḏ twaƹaqben. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Liʼanna lḥukkam war ssiggwiḏen ca wenni iteggen ȓxir, ssaggwaḏen wenni iteggen ccarr. Meȓa ṯexseḏ war teggwḏeḏ ca zi ȓmexzen, tegg ȓxir axak yarḍa. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Aqa netta ḏ axeddam n Arebbi ac infeƹ. Walakin meȓa teggeḏ ccarr ggweḏ zzayes, war iysi ca ssif bȓa ssabab. Netta ḏ axeddam n Arebbi itxeǧas itƹaqab wenni iteggen ccarr. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Falihaḏa labud aḏas ṯṭaƹeḏ i ȓmexzen maci ƹlaḥsab lƹiqab waha, walakin ƹaweḏ ƹlaḥsab ḍḍamir nnec iy ḏac itetten. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Ƹaweḏ ḏ wanita ḏ ssabab iy xef txeǧasem ḍḍariba liʼanna yinni iḥekkmen niṯni ḏ ixeddamen n Arebbi, xeddmen ḏi manaya. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Mkuȓ ijjen ucem-as ȓḥaqq nnes: ḍḍariba i bab n ḍḍariba, ȓaƹcur i bab n ȓaƹcur, lʼiḥtiram i bab n lʼiḥtiram, ȓewqar i bab n ȓewqar.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwajib nneɣ ƹlaḥsab ȓuṣiyaṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Itxeṣṣa war itiȓi ca umarwas jarawem; Lla, itxeṣṣa aḏ yiȓi illa umarwas n ȓemḥibbeṯ. Aqa wenni itexsen unneɣni itwaḥsab ikemmeȓ min yurin ḏi ccariƹa. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Liʼanna ȓuṣiyaṯ nni iy iqqaren war zenna, war neqq, war tacar, war ƹecceq, ḏ ȓuṣiyaṯ nneɣni, marra munent ḏeg yijjen n ȓuṣiyeṯ iqqaren: &lt;Aḏ texseḏ ajjar nnec amecnaw ixef nnec.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Ȓemḥibbeṯ-a war tḍarri ca ajjar nnes. Falihaḏa, ȓemḥibbeṯ tkemmaȓ ccariƹa amen-ṯekmaȓ.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Mayemmi manaya? Kenniw ṯessnem man ȓweqṯ iy ḏi neǧa neccin. Ṯuweḍ-d ṯsaƹƹat ḥima aḏ tfaqem zeg yiḍeṣ. Liʼanna ṯsaƹƹat-a iy ḏi ɣa nenjem ȓexxu aqa ṯqarreb-d ktar zi ṯenni iy ḏi numen ḏ amezwaru. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Ǧiȓeṯ aqa ṯeƹḏu, nhar aqa yuweḍ-d. X manaya labud a nekkes ȓeḥwayej n ṯaǧest, a negg arruḍ n nnur n ȓeḥḏiḏ. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Itxeṣṣa labud a nuyur s lʼiḥtiram am wenni igguren ḏi ṯfawṯ n nhar. War ntegg ca lmadella n ssekra ḏ waṭṭas n ccreb ḏ lfasad ḏ ȓeqbaḥeṯ ḏ umenɣi ḏ ȓeḥseḏ. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Walakin, ggeṯ ȓeḥwayej n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. War rehham ca ak ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nwem, war tseƹƹafeṯ ca ccehawaṯ nnes.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">War tƹeyyab ca x wumac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Fa wenni umi iḍƹef lʼiman nnes qebȓem-ṯ jarawem bȓa ma akiḏes ṯmenɣem x lʼafkar nnes. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Ijjen itwaȓa lmakla marra ḥalal. Ijjen nneɣni wenni ɣar iǧa lʼiman nnes iḍƹef itett ɣir ȓxuḍarṯ. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Wenni itwaȓan marra lmakla ḥalal itxeṣṣa-yas war iseḥqir ca wenni war itetten ca. Ƹaweḏ wenni war itetten ca itxeṣṣa-yas war itƹeyyib ca x wenni itwaȓan lmakla marra ḥalal liʼanna Arebbi iqbeȓ-iṯ. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Cek min ṯeƹniḏ bac aḏ tƹeyybeḏ axeddam n midden? Injeḥ niɣ war injiḥ, wanita ḏ ccɣeȓ n siḏis. U ḏ ṣṣaḥ netta aḏ injeḥ liʼanna Siḏi Arebbi izemmar aṯ isenjeḥ.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Cuf, ijjen itwaȓa ijjen n nhar mubarek zi nhuraṯ nneɣni. Ijjen itwaȓa-ṯen qaƹ kif-kif. Kuȓ ijjen itxeṣṣa-as labud aḏ yiȓi meqtanaƹ mliḥ s array nnes. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Wenni itwaȓan ijjen n nhar mubarak zeg unneɣni aḏ igg manaya bac aḏ iweqqar Siḏi Arebbi. Wenni itetten zi marra lmakla qa itett bac aḏ iweqqar Siḏi Arebbi liʼanna aḏ icekkar Arebbi. Wenni war itetten ca zi marra lmakla qa itegg manaya ḥima aḏ iweqqar Siḏi Arebbi, uȓa ḏ netta aḏ icekkar Arebbi.<verse eid="ROM 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Cuf, war ḏayneɣ ḥadd iddar i yixef nnes, war ḏayneɣ ḥadd itmetta i yixef nnes. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Neccin meȓa neddar, a neddar i Siḏi Arebbi. Meȓa nemmuṯ, a nemmeṯ i Siḏi Arebbi. Falihaḏa, meȓa neddar niɣ nemmuṯ neccin n Siḏi Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Liʼanna x manaya iy xef immuṯ Lmasiḥ uca ṯeƹqeb-d ḏayes ṯuḏarṯ ḥima aḏ yiȓi netta ḏ Siḏiṯsen n yinni immuṯen ḏ yinni iddaren. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Iwa cek mayemmi tƹeyyabeḏ umac? Cek mayemmi ṯseḥqareḏ umac? Neccin marra a nbedd zzaṯ i lƹarc n Arebbi mani iy ɣa netwaḥkem. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Aqa yura ḏi Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;Nec tjaǧiɣ s ṯuḏarṯ inu, iqqar-it Siḏi Arebbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">aqa marra iwḏan aḏayi sejjḏen x ifadden nsen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">mkuȓ iȓes aḏ icheḏ nec ḏ Siḏi Arebbi.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Falihaḏa, mkuȓ ijjen zzayneɣ aḏ itwaḥaseb zzaṯ i Arebbi.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">War ɣeṭṭeȓ ca umac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Iḏen zi ssa aȓ ṯsawent itxeṣṣa-yaneɣ u labud war netƹeyyib ca x wayawya; Lla, itxeṣṣa-kenniw aḏ tfekkarem mliḥ ḥima war ṯɣeṭṭȓem ca ijjen wumaṯwem niɣ aṯ tesfecȓem. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Nec ssneɣ u mteyyqen ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa aqa min nettet war ḏayes bu can ȓḥajeṯ ḥram. Walakin itiȓi ḥram x wenni iy t itwaȓan ḥram. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Liʼanna meȓa itxeyyaq wumac s macca nni iy tetteḏ, ataf cek war ṯuggureḏ ca nican s ȓemḥibbeṯ. War tegg ca macca nnec ḏ ssabab iy zi ɣa inehḏem wumac wenni mix immuṯ Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Amenni war tejjam ca iwḏan aḏ ssiwȓen ccarr x min twaȓim ḏ aṣebḥan. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Liʼanna ȓmulk n Arebbi netta war iǧi ca s macca niɣ ḏ ṯisessi; netta s umṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi ḏ ȓehna ḏ ȓefraḥeṯ s Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Wenni iy ɣa ixeḏmen i Lmasiḥ amenni, aqa Arebbi ireṭṭa xas iwḏan tcekkaren-ṯ.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Iḏen fa itxeṣṣa-yaneɣ u labud a negg lmejhud nneɣ bac a negg min itawin ɣar ȓehna ḏ minzi ɣa ncejjeƹ ayawya. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />War heddem ca ȓxeḏmeṯ n Arebbi ƹlaḥsab lmakla. Ḏ ṣṣaḥ marra min iǧan netta ḥalal, walakin ḏ ȓƹib meȓa ṯɣeḍȓeḏ can yijjen s ssabab n min tetteḏ. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Ḏ ijjen n ȓxir meȓa war tetteḏ ca aysum, niɣ war ṯsesseḏ ca aman uḍiȓ, niɣ ḏ can ȓḥajeṯ nneɣni iy ɣa iɣeḍȓen umac. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Min ma ṯumneḏ x ṯmesȓayin-a, ejj-iṯent jarac-d ḏ Arebbi. Ssaƹḏ n wenni war d itiwin lḥisab ḏ lƹiqab i yixef nnes x min itwaȓa ḥalal. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Walakin meȓa ijjen itett itcekka ḏi lmakla nnes, axas itwaḥakem axas itwaƹaqeb liʼanna war itett ca s lʼiman nnes iy ḏayes. U marra min war itiȓin s lʼiman nni netta ḏ ijjen n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Ḏfar min itegg Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Fa neccin ig ijehḏen itxeṣṣa-yaneɣ a narbu ḍḍuƹef n yinni war ijhiḏen ca, maci a negg min ḏaneɣ iteƹjiben i yixef nneɣ u ṣafi. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Mkuȓ ijjen zzayneɣ itxeṣṣa-yas axas yarḍa wajjar nnes akiḏes igg ȓxir ḥima aḏ ijheḏ. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Liʼanna Lmasiḥ war iggi ca min ḏas iteƹjiben i yixef nnes, igga mammec iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Ȓbaṭeȓ iy xac nnan ifḍeḥ-ayi.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Cuf, marra min yurin ḏi Lkutub ḏi zman urin-ṯ bac azzayes neȓmeḏ neccin. Awaȓ n Arebbi itcejjaƹ-aneɣ, itawi-yaneɣ-d ṣṣbar ḥima aɣarneɣ yiȓi lʼamal. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Arebbi iƹni wenni iticcen ṣṣbar itcejjaƹ-ikenniw, ataf akenniw ismun ḥima aḏ tiȓim ḏ ijjen xmi ṯḏeffarem Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />bac aḏ tḥemḏem Arebbi Babas n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ s yijjen n array ḏ yijjen n uqemmum. <verse eid="ROM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />S manaya qebȓeṯ ayawya mammec iy kenniw iqbeȓ Lmasiḥ ḥima aḏ tsemɣarem Arebbi.<verse eid="ROM 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Cuf, nec qqareɣ-awem Lmasiḥ yusa-d ḥima aḏ yiȓi ḏ axeddam n Ayṯ-Israʼil bac aḏ d ismeḍhar lḥaqiqa n Arebbi aḏ igg min iwƹeḏ ssalaf ṣṣaliḥin. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Ƹaweḏ bac yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏ ḥemḏen Arebbi x arraḥmeṯ nnes. Mammec iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">&lt;S manaya iy cek ɣa ḥemḏeɣ jar ȓegnus,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">aḏ ɣennjeɣ izȓan i yisem nnec.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Iqqar Lkitab ƹaweḏ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">&lt;Farḥeṯ ya ȓegnus ak ccaƹb nnes!&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Iqqar ƹaweḏ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">&lt;Ḥemḏeṯ Siḏi Arebbi, ya ȓegnus marra iḏwem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">Ḥemḏem-ṯ, marra iḏwem ya ccuƹub!&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Iqqar ƹaweḏ nnabi Icaƹya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">&lt;Aḏ iɣmi uẓwer n Yassa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yassa netta ḏ babas n Siḏna Dawed.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">netta iy ɣa ikkaren aḏ iḥkem x ȓegnus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">aḏayes ggen ȓegnus lʼamal.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Arebbi wenni iticcen lʼamal, akenniw iccur s ȓefraḥeṯ ḏ ȓehna wami zzayes ṯumnem bac aḏ tenfeyyḍem s lʼamal s jjheḏ n Arruḥ iqeddsen.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus netta ḏ arrasul ɣar yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Ay ayṯma, nec mteyyqen belli kenniw ṯeccurem s ȓxir ḏ marra ṯusna,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯusna nettaṯ ḏ lmaƹrifa.</char></note> ṯzemmarem aḏ tesȓemḏem ayawya. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15-16" />Walakin zeƹmeɣ uriɣ <char style="it">ṯabrat-a</char> ɣarwem x ȓebƹaḍ n ṯmesȓayin ḥima war ṯent tettum ca. Liʼanna nec teggeɣ ȓxeḏmeṯ n ȓefqi tbeccareɣ s wawaȓ n Arebbi s lbaraka nni iy ḏayi yuca bac aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ axeddam n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ i kenniw war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. Ḥima akenniw qeddmeɣ am yijjen n ṣṣeḏqeṯ ṯeṣfa s Arruḥ iqeddsen ḥima at iqbeȓ Arebbi. <verse eid="ROM 15:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Falihaḏa s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ aḏ ftaxareɣ s ȓxeḏmeṯ inu i Arebbi.<verse eid="ROM 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Cuf, zeƹmeɣ aḏ ssiwȓeɣ ɣir x min ixeddem Lmasiḥ x ufus inu ḥima yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏ ṭaƹen i Arebbi s wawaȓ ḏ ȓexḏayem inu, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />iƹni s jjheḏ n lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ lburhanaṯ iy d yusin s jjheḏ n Arruḥ n Arebbi. Ammu iy beccareɣ s Lʼinjil n Lmasiḥ ḏi mkuȓ amcan iƹni zi ṯendint n Lquds aȓ jwayeh n Ilirya. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />U nec rezzuɣ aḏ tbeccareɣ ȓebda s Lʼinjil ḏi ṯmura mani war xas tesȓin ca x Lmasiḥ bac war benniɣ ca x ca n dsas ig igga ḥadd nneɣni. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Mammec iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">&lt;Yinni war xas itwaxebbaren aḏ twaȓan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">yinni war xas itsȓin aḏ fehmen.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ḏ wa ḏ ssabab iy ḏayi iṭṭfen aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin war ɣarwem d usiɣ ca.<verse eid="ROM 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus irezzu aḏ iraḥ ɣar ṯendint n Ruma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Walakin ȓexxu war ɣari bu umcan aḏ xeḏmeɣ ḏi jwayeh-a, u nec mecḥaȓ zeg wami iy rezzuɣ aḏ d aseɣ akenniw ẓreɣ. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Xmi ɣa raḥeɣ ɣar Spanya tmenniɣ axawem d kkeɣ, akiḏwem qqimeɣ akiḏwem farḥeɣ cwayt n ȓweqṯ. Nec tmenniɣ zzaywem aḏayi ṯƹawnem aḏ kemmȓeɣ x ubriḏ inu. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Walakin ȓexxu aqa ggureɣ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds bac aḏ ƹawneɣ ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin iy ḏinni. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Liʼanna ȓmuminin iy iǧan ḏi jwayeh n Masidunya ḏ Uxaya texsen aḏ ƹawnen ipubriṯen iy iǧan jar ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin ḏi ṯendint n Lquds. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Aqa niṯni texsen ad ggen manaya, manaya ḏ ṣṣaḥ ḏ ijjen n lwajib aqaṯ xasen. Mayemmi? Liʼanna yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil meȓa ysin zi lbaraka ruḥiya n israʼiliyen, itxeṣṣa-yasen labud yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏ ƹawnen israʼiliyen s wagȓa nsen. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Iḏen xmi ɣa kemmȓeɣ ccɣeȓ-a aḏasen ssiwḍeɣ marra lmuƹawana-ya, axawem d kkeɣ xmi ɣa raḥeɣ ɣar Spanya. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />U nec ssneɣ xmi ɣarwem d ɣa aseɣ, aḏ d aseɣ s yijjen n ȓmudd<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ȓmudd netta ḏ ijjen n uqedduḥ tuɣa ƹebbaren ḏayes imendi niɣ irḏan ḏ ṯmesȓayin nneɣni ḏi zman.</char></note> iccur s lbaraka n Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Fa tettareɣ zzaywem ay ayṯma, s Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ n Arruḥ n Arebbi aḏ tbeddem akiḏi s ṯẓaǧiṯ nwem ɣar Arebbi s ssabab inu. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Ẓẓaǧeṯ ḥima nec aḏ nejmeɣ zeg ifassen n yinni war yuminen ca ḏi jwayeh n Yahuḏiya, u ƹaweḏ bac ȓxeḏmeṯ inu ḏi Lquds at qebȓen ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin iy ḏinni. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Ȓexddenni, meȓa ixes Arebbi aɣarwem d aseɣ s ȓefraḥeṯ a nreyyeḥ ag wayawya. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Arebbi n ȓehna akiḏwem yiȓi marra iḏwem. Amin.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Bulus itseǧam x can ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Ruma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Fa tweṣṣiɣ-kenniw x učmaṯneɣ Fifi ig ixeddmen i jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Kanxarya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Reḥḥbeṯ zzayes ƹlaḥsab Siḏiṯneɣ, iƹni ijjen n ureḥḥeb iy sḏaheǧen ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin. Ƹawnem-t ḏi marra min teḥḏaj zzaywem ȓaḥeqqac nettaṯ tƹawan aṭṭas n yiwḏan, tƹawan-ayi uȓa ḏ nec. <verse eid="ROM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Siwḍem-asen sȓam i Priskila ḏ Wakilas, yinni akiḏi ixeddmen ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Ɣamaren s ṯuḏarṯ nsen x ssabab inu. War iǧi ɣir nec iy ṯen itcekkaren, walakin tcekkarent-ṯen marra ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Siwḍem-asen sȓam ƹaweḏ i jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin itmunan ḏi ṯeddarṯ n ṯnayen-a. Siwḍem-as sȓam i umƹizz inu Ipantus wenni iy yumnen ḏ amezwaru s Lmasiḥ ḏi lʼiqlim n Asya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Siwḍem-as sȓam i Maryam ig ixeddmen aṭṭas xawem. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Siwḍem-asen sȓam i Andruni ḏ Yunyas ȓeḥbab inu, yinni tuɣa akiḏi ḏi ȓeḥbes. Niṯni maƹrufin jar arrusul, umnen zi Lmasiḥ qbeȓ ma aḏ amneɣ nec.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Siwḍem-as sȓam i Amfilawus, amƹizzi inu ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Siwḍem-asen sȓam i Urban wenni ixeddmen akiḏi ḏi Lmasiḥ ḏ umƹizz inu Staxis. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Siwḍem-as sȓam i Apilas wenni itwamellken ḏi Lmasiḥ. Siwḍem-asen sȓam ƹaweḏ i lƹaʼila n Aristubus. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Siwḍem-as sȓam i Ḥarudi wenni iǧan zi ȓeḥbab inu. Siwḍem-asen sȓam i lƹaʼila n Narqis yinni itamnen s Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Siwḍem-asent sȓam i Ḍrifuna ḏ Ḍrifisa ṯinni ixeddmen aṭṭas ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ. Siwḍem-as sȓam i Ṯafersist iy xaneɣ iƹizzen, ṯxeddem aṭṭas ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Siwḍem-asen sȓam i Arufus wenni itwaxḍaren ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ uȓa ḏ yemmas iy ḥessbeɣ am yemma. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Siwḍem-asen sȓam i Sinkritus ḏ Filgun ḏ Harmas ḏ Patrubas ḏ Hirmis ḏ ayṯmaṯsen iy kisen iǧan. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Siwḍem-asen sȓam i Filuɣi ḏ Julya ḏ Lumbas ḏ Niryus ak učmas ḏ marra ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin iy kiḏsen iǧan. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Seǧmeṯ x wayawya s yijjen n sȓam iṣfa. Qa marra ṯijumaƹ n Lmasiḥ tseǧament xawem.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyeṯ ṯanegarut zi Arrasul Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Ay ayṯma, tettareɣ zzaywem aḏ teḥḍam ixef nwem zeg yinni iferrqen ȓmuminin x wayawya teggen-awem min isefciȓen, iƹni ḍed ṯɣuri nni iy ṯȓemḏem kenniw. Beƹƹḏeṯ xasen x yina. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Liʼanna yina war xeddmen ca i Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, xeddmen ɣir i uƹeddis nsen waha. S wawaȓ yiziḍen ḏ lmuhawaḍa izewwqen xeddƹen uȓawen n yinni iy ḏi ṯeǧa nniyyeṯ. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kenniw, sȓin xawem iwḏan marra x ṭṭaƹa nwem, nec farḥeɣ zzaywem x manayenni. Walakin xseɣ kenniw aḏ tiȓim ḏ ifṭanen x min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan, aḏ tɣefȓem x min iǧan ḏ ccarr. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Arebbi n ȓehna netta ƹȓayen aḏ iȓbeẓ Cciṭan swadday i iḍaren nwem. Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Issiweḍ-awem-d sȓam Timutawus wenni ixeddmen akiḏi, ḏ ȓeḥbab inu iƹni Luqyus ḏ Yasin ḏ Sibatru.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Nec Tartyus ssiwḍeɣ-awem-d ijjen n sȓam ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ, nec ig yurin ṯabrat-a.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Issiweḍ-awem-d sȓam Ɣayus, ḏ netta iy zzayi ireḥḥben ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnes irzem-it i marra jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin. Issiweḍ-awem-d sȓam Arisṭus lʼamin n ṣṣenduq n ṯendint,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Netta itkellaf zi tmenyaṯ iy iǧan ḏi ṯcemmusin n ṯendint.</char></note> ḏ umaṯneɣ Qartus. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />{Axawem yiȓi marra iḏwem arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Amin.}<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Itwabarak Arebbi! Netta ḏ wenni izemmaren aḏawem yuc jjheḏ s Lʼinjil-a iy tbeccareɣ u ƹaweḏ s uḥeddeṯ n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ƹlaḥsab min d ibanen tuɣaṯ manayenni zi zman inuffar. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Ȓexxu iban-d manaya i yiwḏan itwassen s Lkutub n lʼanbiya. Arebbi iƹni wenni itduman i ȓebda yumar azzayes amnen marra ȓegnus aḏas ṭaƹen. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Arebbi waḥḏes iy ɣar ṯeǧa lḥikma, aɣares ṯiȓi lƹaḍama i netta i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ! Amin.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>